    ["Bring 1 Qiraji Spiked Hilt, 2 Azure Idols, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Warden Haro in Silithus. You must also attain Exalted reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest."] = "將1件其拉尖刺護裙、2個碧藍雕像、5個銀質甲蟲和5個白骨甲蟲交給安其拉甲蟲之墻後的守望者哈爾洛。妳必須在塞納裏奧議會中達到崇拜聲望才能完成這個任務。",
    ["Bring 10 Barbecued Buzzard Wings and 5 bottles of Junglevine Wine to Captain Smotts' Lifeboat.Kill Negolash, and bring Smotts' Cutlass to Captain Smotts in Stranglethorn."] = "將10塊燒烤禿鷹翅膀和5瓶密林葡萄酒帶到斯莫特船長的救生艇上去。  然後殺死奈古拉什，將斯莫特的彎刀交給荊棘谷的斯莫特船長。",
    ["Bring 10 Bundles of Akiris Reed to Privateer Bloads in Booty Bay."] = "給藏寶海灣的海盜布勞茲帶回10根海蛇草。",
    ["Bring 10 Filled Pure Sample Jars to Laris Geardawdle in Ironforge.If you have trouble finding them, perhaps try to get more clues from Laris."] = "將10個純凈樣本瓶交給鐵爐堡的拉裏斯·空輪。  如果妳無法找到它們的話，不妨到拉裏斯那裏去再打聽壹些線索。",
    ["Bring 10 Highperch Venom Sacs to Fiora Longears in Theramore."] = "收集10個風巢雙足飛龍的毒囊，把它們帶給塞拉摩的菲歐拉·長耳。",
    ["Bring 10 Monstrous Crawler Legs to Dar in the Swamp of Sorrows."] = "給悲傷沼澤的達爾帶去10條巨大的螃蟹腿。",
    ["Bring 10 Morrowgrain to Quintis Jonespyre in Feathermoon Stronghold."] = "將10株晨光麥交給羽月要塞的奎恩提斯。",
    ["Bring 10 Rage Scar Yeti Hides to Pratt McGrubben at Feathermoon Stronghold, Feralas."] = "把10塊怒痕雪人的毛皮交給菲拉斯羽月要塞的普拉特·馬克格魯比。",
    ["Bring 10 Scarlet Insignia Rings to Deathguard Burgess in Brill."] = "給布瑞爾的亡靈衛兵伯吉斯帶回10枚血色十字軍徽記之戒。",
    ["Bring 10 Singing Blue Crystals to Crank Fizzlebub in Booty Bay."] = "給藏寶海灣的克蘭克·菲茲巴布帶回10塊藍色歌唱水晶。",
    ["Bring 10 Thick Yeti Hides to Jangdor Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache."] = "給莫沙徹營地的杉多爾·迅蹄帶去十張厚重的雪人皮。",
    ["Bring 10 Twilight Pendants to Argent Guard Manados in Darnassus."] = "收集10個暮光墜飾，把它們交給達納蘇斯的銀月守衛瑪納杜斯。",
    ["Bring 10 Webwood Venom Sacs to Gilshalan Windwalker at Aldrassil."] = "給奧達希爾的基爾沙蘭·風行者帶回10個樹林蜘蛛的毒囊。",
    ["Bring 10 vials of Mountain Lion Blood to Apothecary Lydon in Tarren Mill."] = "收集10瓶山地獅的血液，把它們交給塔倫米爾的藥劑師林度恩。",
    ["Bring 12 Red Burlap Bandanas to Deputy Willem outside the Northshire Abbey."] = "給北郡的維裏副隊長帶回12個紅色粗麻面罩。",
    ["Bring 12 Silithid Eggs and the Digging Claw to Korran at the Crossroads."] = "把12枚異種蠍卵和掘地爪交給十字路口的科蘭。",
    ["Bring 12 Timberling Sprouts to Denalan at Lake Al'Ameth."] = "給奧拉密斯湖邊的德納蘭帶去12個林精的新芽。",
    ["Bring 12 Tunnel Rat Ears to Mountaineer Kadrell in Thelsamar."] = "收集12只坑道鼠的耳朵，把它們帶給塞爾薩瑪的巡山人卡德雷爾。",
    ["Bring 12 pieces of Light Leather to Veren Tallstrider in Thunder Bluff."] = "收集12塊輕皮，把它們交給雷霆崖的維爾倫·陸行者。",
    ["Bring 12 samples of Zanzil's Mixture to Crank Fizzlebub in Booty Bay."] = "收集12份贊吉爾的藥劑，把它們交給藏寶海灣的克蘭克·菲茲巴布。",
    ["Bring 15 Cenarion Combat Badges, 20 Cenarion Logistics Badges, 17 Cenarion Tactical Badges and 1 Mark of Remulos to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest."] = "把15枚作戰徽章、20枚後勤徽章、17枚戰術徽章和1枚雷姆洛斯印記交給塞納裏奧要塞的瓦古斯。妳必須在塞納裏奧議會中達到崇敬聲望才能完成這個任務。",
    ["Bring 15 Cenarion Combat Badges, 20 Cenarion Logistics Badges, 20 Cenarion Tactical Badges and 1 Mark of Cenarius to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Exalted reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest."] = "把15枚作戰徽章、20枚後勤徽章、20枚戰術徽章和1枚塞納留斯印記交給塞納裏奧要塞的瓦古斯。妳必須在塞納裏奧議會中達到崇拜聲望才能完成這個任務。",
    ["Bring 15 Centaur Bracers to Regthar Deathgate, west of the Crossroads."] = "收集15個半人馬護腕，把他們交給十字路口的雷戈薩·死門。",
    ["Bring 15 Centaur Ears to Corporal Melkins at Nijel's Point in Desolace."] = "收集15個半人馬耳朵，把它們交給尼耶爾前哨站的麥爾金斯下士。",
    ["Bring 15 Red Leather Bandanas to Scout Galiaan at Sentinel Hill."] = "給哨兵嶺的哨兵加裏安帶回15條紅色皮質面罩。",
    ["Bring 20 Shrunken Heads to Nimboya at the Grom'gol Base Camp."] = "給格羅姆高營地的尼姆布亞帶去20個皺縮的頭顱。",
    ["Bring 25 Split Bone Necklaces to Kin'weelay at the Grom'gol Base camp."] = "給格羅姆高營地的肯維雷帶回25串裂骨項鏈。",
    ["Bring 30 Runecloth to Meilosh in Timbermaw Hold."] = "把30塊符文布交給木喉要塞的梅羅什。",
    ["Bring 5 Cenarion Combat Badges, 3 Cenarion Logistics Badges and 7 Cenarion Tactical Badges to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Friendly reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest."] = "將5個塞納里奧作戰徽章，3個塞納里奧後勤徽章，和7個塞納里奧戰術徽章帶到希利蘇斯給塞納里奧城堡的瓦古斯。你還必須在塞納里奧議會達到友好聲望值才能完成這個任務。",
    ["Bring 5 Charged Thunder Lizard Organs to Rezlak near Drygulch Ravine."] = "把5個充能的雷霆蜥蜴內臟拿去給枯水谷附近的雷茲拉克。",
    ["Bring 5 Iron Pikes and 5 Iron Rivets to Foreman Oslow in Lakeshire."] = "給湖畔鎮的工頭奧斯洛帶回5根鐵矛和5個鐵鉚釘。",
    ["Bring 5 Mossy Tumors to Rellian Greenspyre in Darnassus."] = "收集5個青苔之瘤，然後把它們交給達納蘇斯的雷利亞·綠樹。",
    ["Bring 5 Scaber Stalks and 1 Death Cap to Barithras Moonshade in Auberdine."] = "收集5個粗柄蘑菇和1個毒帽蘑菇，把它們交給奧伯丁的巴瑞薩斯·月影。",
    ["Bring 5 twitching antennae to Ruga Ragetotem at Camp Taurajo."] = "收集5根顫抖的觸角，把它們帶給貧瘠之地陶拉祖營地的魯迦。",
    ["Bring 6 Mathystra Relics to Onu at the Grove of the Ancients."] = "收集6個黑暗深淵遺物，把它們交給古樹之林的安努。",
    ["Bring 6 Red Linen Bandanas to Sara Timberlain at the Eastvale Logging Camp."] = "給東谷伐木場的薩拉·迪博雷恩帶去6塊紅色亞麻布面罩。",
    ["Bring 6 Shimmerweeds to Rejold Barleybrew in the Brewnall Village."] = "收集6束微光草，把它們交給烈酒村的雷傑德·麥酒。",
    ["Bring 6 samples of Lake Creeper Moss, 6 samples of Lake Skulker Moss and a Hardened Tumor to Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity."] = "收集6份湖岸爬行者苔蘚的樣本、6份湖岸潛藏者苔蘚的樣本和1塊硬瘤，把它們交給幽暗城的大藥劑師法拉尼爾。",
    ["Bring 60 Bristleback Quilboar Tusks to Mankrik at the Crossroads."] = "收集60根刺背野豬人的獠牙，把它們交給十字路口的曼科裏克。",
    ["Bring 7 Cenarion Combat Badges, 4 Cenarion Logistics Badges and 4 Cenarion Tactical Badges to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Honored reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest."] = "把7枚作戰徽章、4枚後勤徽章和4枚戰術徽章交給塞納裏奧要塞的瓦古斯。妳必須在塞納裏奧議會中達到友善聲望才能完成這個任務。",
    ["Bring 7 Jungle Remedies and 1 Venom Fern Extract to Sergeant Yohwa at the Rebel Camp."] = "給反抗軍營地裏的尤瓦中士帶回7份密林藥劑和1份毒草汁液。",
    ["Bring 8 Crystalized Scales to Collin Mauren in Stormwind."] = "給暴風城的科林·瑪倫帶回8片水晶鱗片。",
    ["Bring 8 Dentrium Power Stones and 8 An'Alleum Power Stones to Rigglefuzz in the Badlands."] = "給荒蕪之地的裏格弗茲帶去8塊德提亞姆能量石和8塊安納洛姆能量石。",
    ["Bring 8 Dinosaur Bones to Spark Nilminer in Un'Goro Crater."] = "將8根恐龍骨頭交給安戈洛環形山的斯巴克·尼米爾。",
    ["Bring 8 Ghost-o-plasms and the Crate of Ghost Magnets to Hornizz Brimbuzzle in Desolace."] = "把幽靈磁鐵箱和8份幽靈電漿交給淒涼之地的霍恩尼茲。",
    ["Bring 8 Gnoll Paws to Captain Danuvin on Sentinel Hill."] = "給哨兵嶺的丹努文隊長帶回8只豺狼人的爪子。",
    ["Bring 8 Murloc Fins to Dockmaster Baren in Lakeshire."] = "給湖畔鎮的碼頭管理員巴倫帶回8片魚人的鰭。",
    ["Bring 8 Painted Gnoll Armbands to Deputy Rainer at the Barracks."] = "給兵營的瑞尼爾副隊長帶去8個彩色豺狼人臂章。",
    ["Bring 8 Root Samples to Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet."] = "把根須樣本交給棘齒城的麥伯克·米希瑞克斯。",
    ["Bring 8 Torn Murloc Fins to Guard Thomas at the east Elwynn bridge."] = "給艾爾文森林東部的橋邊的衛兵托馬斯帶去8個破損的魚人鱗片。",
    ["Bring 8 pieces of Tough Wolf Meat to Eagan Peltskinner outside Northshire Abbey."] = "給北郡修道院外的伊根·派特斯金納帶回8塊硬狼肉。",
    ["Bring 9 Blue Pearls to Rigglefuzz in the Badlands."] = "收集9枚藍珍珠，把它們交給荒蕪之地的裏格弗茲。",
