    ["Bring a Prairie Wolf Heart, Flatland Cougar Femur, Plainstrider Scale and Swoop Gizzard to Maur Raincaller at Bloodhoof Village."] = "收集草原狼的心臟、平原獅的腿骨、平原陸行鳥的鱗片和猛鷲的胃各壹份，把它們交給血蹄村的茂爾·祈雨。",
