    ["Bring a Shadowcraft Belt and a set of Shadowcraft Gloves to Mokvar in Orgrimmar."] = "將迅影腰帶和1套迅影手套帶給奧格瑪的莫克瓦。",
    ["Bring a Webwood Egg to Gilshalan in Aldrassil."] = "給奧達希爾的基爾莎蘭帶回1枚樹林蜘蛛的卵。",
    ["Bring a Wind-Infused Bough to Belann Windwood in Valanaar."] = "把風能灌注樹枝交給瓦拉納爾的貝藍‧風木。",
    ["Bring a scale of Old Murk-Eye to Captain Grayson at the Westfall Lighthouse."] = "將老瞎眼的鱗片交給西部荒野燈塔旁的葛瑞森船長。",
    ["Bring a sign of Kron's fate to Misha Tor'kren at the farmstead northwest of Razor Hill."] = "把關於克魯恩的消息告訴剃刀嶺西北部農場中的米莎·托克倫。",
    ["Bring an Elder Crocolisk Skin to Drizzlik in Booty Bay."] = "給藏寶海灣的崔斯裏克帶回1張老鱷魚的皮。",
    ["Bring five Duskbat Pelts and some Coarse Thread to Gretchen Dedmar in Brill."] = "給布瑞爾的格雷森·戴德馬帶回5張夜行蝙蝠的毛皮和壹些粗線。",
    ["Bring five Tamed Kodos and the Kodo Kombobulator back to Smeed Scrabblescrew at Scrabblescrew's Camp."] = "將科多獸誘引器和5頭被馴服的科多獸交給瑟卡布斯庫的營地中的斯米德·瑟卡布斯庫。",
    ["Bring some Patterned Bronze Bracers to Lucien Tosselwrench in the Badlands."] = "給荒蕪之地的盧希恩·槍穗帶去壹些青銅花紋護腕。",
