    ["Bring the the Carapace of the Old God, 2 Idols of the Sage, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Vethsera inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Honored reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest."] = "把上古之神的甲殼、2個先知塑像、5個銀質甲蟲和5個白骨甲蟲交給安其拉的溫瑟拉。妳必須在諾茲多姆的子嗣中達到尊敬聲望才能完成這個任務。",
    ["Bring the the Husk of the Old God, 2 Idols of Death, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Vethsera inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Honored reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest."] = "把上古之神的外鞘、2個死亡塑像、5個巖石甲蟲和5個水晶甲蟲交給安其拉的溫瑟拉。妳必須在諾茲多姆的子嗣中達到尊敬聲望才能完成這個任務。",
    ["Bring the the Husk of the Old God, 2 Idols of Night, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Vethsera inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Honored reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest."] = "把上古之神的外鞘、2個夜晚塑像、5個巖石甲蟲和5個水晶甲蟲交給安其拉的溫瑟拉。妳必須在諾茲多姆的子嗣中達到尊敬聲望才能完成這個任務。",
    ["Bring the the Husk of the Old God, 2 Idols of Rebirth, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Vethsera inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Honored reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest."] = "把上古之神的外鞘、2個復生塑像、5個青銅甲蟲和5個象牙甲蟲交給安其拉的溫瑟拉。妳必須在諾茲多姆的子嗣中達到尊敬聲望才能完成這個任務。",
    ["Bring twenty-four Robo-mechanical Guts to Shoni in Stormwind."] = "收集24副機械內膽，把它們交給暴風城的舒尼。",
    ["Buy or catch a Raw Brilliant Smallfish, then use the Knife Set to fillet it in front of Boarton Shadetotem in Thunder Bluff."] = "購買或捕捉一隻新鮮的美味小魚，接著用到雷霆崖在波爾頓‧暗影圖騰面前用刀具組處理小魚。",
    ["Cairne Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff wants you to bring him the Horn of Arra'chea."] = "雷霆崖的凱恩·血蹄要妳將阿蘭其亞的角帶給他。",
    ["Captain Steelgut in Faldir's Cove wants you to kill 10 Daggerspine Raiders and 3 Daggerspine Sorceresses."] = "法迪爾海灣的斯迪加特船長要妳去殺掉10個刺脊襲擊者和3個刺脊巫師。",
    ["Captain Thalo'thas Brightsun of Ratchet wants you to collect 10 Theramore Medals and slay Captain Fairmount, Cannoneer Whessan and Cannoneer Smythe."] = "棘齒城中的沙羅薩斯船長要妳收集10枚塞拉摩徽章並幹掉法莫斯隊長、炮兵維桑恩和炮兵斯密瑟。",
    ["Claim your reward from Hydraxis' Coffer."] = "從海達克西斯的箱子拿取妳的獎勵。",
    ["Collect 10 Al'Aketh Cultist's Ears from the Al'Aketh cultists in Shadowgale Forest, the Shine of Akir, or Gustberry Lowlands."] = "在影風森林、奧基爾聖殿和風莓低地收集5個奧拉凱斯教徒的耳朵。",
    ["Collect 10 Al'Aketh Windstone Charms from Al'Aketh cultists found north of Valanaar at the Gustberry Fields or Shrine of Akir."] = "前往瓦拉納爾北邊的風莓低地或奧基爾聖殿，從那裡的奧拉凱斯教徒身上收集10個奧拉凱斯風石符咒。",
    ["Collect 10 Water Elemental Cores from the Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays along the Forgotten Coast of Feralas, and bring them back to Zorbin Fandazzle who is near the dock there."] = "從菲拉斯被遺忘的海岸那裏的海元素和巨型海元素身上獲取10塊水元素核心，把它們交給碼頭附近的索爾賓·範達瑟。",
    ["Collect 12 pieces of Sturdy Lumber from Shadowvale in Tirisfal Glades."] = "從提里斯法林地的暗影谷收集12個結實的木材。",
    ["Collect 25 Intact Limbs within The Ruins of Lordaeron for Morbin Lightbane in the Undercity."] = "為幽暗城的莫賓‧光寂在羅德隆廢墟內收集25份完好的肢體。",
    ["Collect 25 Ogre Warbeads from Ogres inside Dire Maul or Blackrock Spire and return to Falrin Treeshaper inside the Athenaeum in Dire Maul."] = "從厄運之槌或黑石塔的巨魔身上收集25個巨魔戰爭串珠再回到厄運之槌圖書館找法琳·樹形者。",
    ["Collect 25 Theradric Crystal Carvings for Willow in Desolace."] = "為淒涼之地的維洛收集25個瑟萊德絲水晶雕像。",
    ["Collect 5 Prospector's Picks.At a forge, smash the Prospector's Picks to create Broken Tools.Bring 5 Broken Tools to Baine Bloodhoof in Bloodhoof Village."] = "收集5個勘察員的鋤頭。  在鐵匠鋪砸碎這些勘察員的鋤頭。  把5件損壞的工具交給血蹄村的貝恩·血蹄。",
    ["Collect 6 Azure Feathers and 6 Bronze Feathers, and bring them to Eyahn Eagletalon in Thunder Bluff."] = "收集6根碧藍色的羽毛和6根古銅色的羽毛，把它們交給雷霆崖的伊恩·鷹爪。",
    ["Collect 6 Fine Crab Chunks for Gubber Blump in Auberdine."] = "收集6塊優質蟹肉，把它們交給奧伯丁的古博·布拉普。",
    ["Collect 6 Giant Crocolisk Skins and bring them to James Halloran in Menethil Harbor."] = "為米奈希爾港的詹姆斯·哈洛蘭帶回6張巨型鱷魚的皮。",
    ["Collect 6 Scrawny Ursera Claws from Scrawny Ursera in Thendal Grove."] = "在坦德爾林地從瘦弱的熊獸身上收集6個瘦弱熊獸的爪子。",
    ["Collect 7 Hyacinth Mushrooms, 4 Moonpetal Lilies, and 1 Webwood Ichor for Dirania Silveshine in Shadowglen."] = "在幽影谷中為迪蘭妮亞·月光收集7朵紫藍色蘑菇、4朵月牙百合花和壹份樹林蜘蛛的膿液。",
    ["Collect 8 Fel Moss and bring them to Tarindrella."] = "收集8塊魔苔，把它們交給塔琳德拉。",
    ["Collect 8 Webbed Diemetradon Scales and 8 Webbed Pterrordax Scales for Shizzle in Marshal's Refuge."] = "為馬紹爾營地的希茲爾收集8塊精細的雙帆龍鱗片和8塊精細的翼手龍鱗片。",
    ["Collect ingredients for murloc bait."] = "收集6瓶動物之血和18片暮色草花瓣當作魚人誘餌，然後回去閃金鎮找雷米。",
    ["Collect the Highly Toxic Strain from Witherfang in Ruins of Lordaeron for Theodore Griffs in Undercity."] = "為幽暗城的席歐多‧格雷夫從羅德隆廢墟的枯萎之牙身上收集劇毒菌株。",
    ["Collect the Warsong Supplies: Warsong Saw Blades, Logging Rope, Warsong Oil, and the Warsong Axe Shipment for Locke Okarr in Splintertree Post."] = "收集戰歌氏族的補給品：戰歌鋸條、伐木繩、戰歌之油，還有壹箱戰歌之斧。",
    ["Collect the missing pages from The Green Hills of Stranglethorn manuscript. Once all four chapters are complete, return them to Barnil."] = "收集《荊棘谷的青山》的手稿中丟失的頁面。在集齊四章書之後，將它們還給巴尼爾·石罐。",
    ["Commander Aggro'gosh of the Grom'gol base camp wants you to kill 10 Ogre Brutes and 5 Ogre Witch Doctors."] = "格羅姆高營地的指揮官阿格羅戈什要求妳殺死10個食人魔蠻兵和5個食人魔巫醫。",
    ["Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Redemption Boots if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Boots, 12 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 2 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的指揮官艾利格·黎明使者將為你製作救贖長靴，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1雙被褻瀆的長靴，12個受戰爭破壞的鎧甲碎塊，2個奧金錠和3塊熟化毛皮。",
    ["Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Redemption Handguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Handguards, 8 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 5 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的指揮官艾利格·黎明使者將為你製作救贖手甲，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1對被褻瀆的手甲，8個受戰爭破壞的鎧甲碎塊，1個奧金錠和5塊熟化毛皮。",
    ["Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Redemption Wristguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Wristguards, 6 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 2 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的指揮官艾利格·黎明使者將為你製作救贖腕甲，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1對被褻瀆的束腕，6個受戰爭破壞的鎧甲碎塊，1個奧金錠和2塊熟化毛皮。",
    ["Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Redemption Girdle if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Girdle, 8 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 3 Nexus Crystals."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的指揮官艾利格·黎明使者將為你製作救贖束腰，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1條被褻瀆的束腰，8個受戰爭破壞的鎧甲碎塊，1個奧金錠和3個聯結水晶。",
    ["Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Redemption Headpiece if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Headpiece, 15 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 5 Arcanite Bars and 2 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的指揮官艾利格·黎明使者將為你製作救贖首盔，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1個被褻瀆的首盔，15個受戰爭破壞的鎧甲碎塊，5個奧金錠和2塊熟化毛皮。",
    ["Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Redemption Tunic if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Tunic, 25 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的指揮官艾利格·黎明使者將為你製作救贖外套，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1件被褻瀆的外套，25個受戰爭破壞的鎧甲碎塊，4個奧金錠和3塊熟化毛皮。",
    ["Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a pair of Redemption Legguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Legguards, 20 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 2 Nexus Crystals."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的指揮官艾利格·黎明使者將為你製作救贖腿甲，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1對被褻瀆的腿甲，20個受戰爭破壞的鎧甲碎塊，4個奧金錠和2個聯結水晶。",
    ["Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a pair of Redemption Spaulders if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Spaulders, 12 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 2 Arcanite Bars and 2 Nexus Crystals."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的指揮官艾利格·黎明使者將為你製作救贖肩甲，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1對被褻瀆的肩甲，12個受戰爭破壞的鎧甲碎塊，2個奧金錠和2個聯結水晶。",
    ["Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to find his beloved Natalia. The information that you gathered points to Hive'Regal in the south as being the area in which you may find Mistress Natalia Mar'alith.Do not forget to visit the dwarves at Bronzebeard's camp before venturing into the hive. They might have some additional work and advice for you.And &lt;name&gt;, remember the Commander's words: \"Do what you must...\"."] = "希利蘇斯塞納裏奧要塞的指揮官瑪爾利斯想要妳找到他心愛的納塔莉亞。妳收集到的信息表明納塔莉亞·瑪爾利斯可能在南面的雷戈蟲巢。  在妳趕往蟲巢之前，記得去銅須營地拜訪壹下那兒的矮人，他們或許會給妳提些建議。  <name>，記住指揮官的話：做妳應該做的……",
    ["Confront Belthaan Brightwish along the road to the Shrine of Akir."] = "在前往奧基爾聖殿的路上面對貝拉桑‧亮願。",
    ["Consume the Water of the Seers in front of the tribal fire in Bloodhoof Village and follow the vision once it appears. Provided item:."] = "在血蹄村的部族之火前將先知之水喝下，當幻象出現之後跟隨它。",
    ["Councilman Millstipe of Darkshire wants you to bring him the hand of Dextren Ward."] = "夜色鎮的米爾斯迪普議員要妳殺死迪克斯特·瓦德，並把他的手帶回來作為證明。",
    ["Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 4 Frozen Runes, 12 Enchanted Leather, 3 Essence of Water, 3 Cured Rugged Hides and 200 gold."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的工匠維爾海姆需要你帶給他4個冰凍符文，12塊附魔皮，3個水之精華，3塊熟化毛皮，還有200金。",
    ["Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 4 Frozen Runes, 12 Thorium Bars, 2 Arcanite Bars, 2 Essence of Water and 200 gold."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的工匠維爾海姆需要你帶給他4個冰凍符文，12個瑟銀錠，2個奧金錠，2個水之精華，還有200金。",
    ["Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 4 Frozen Runes, 2 Bolts of Runecloth, 2 Essences of Water, 2 Ironweb Spider Silks and 200 gold."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的工匠維爾海姆需要你帶給他4個冰凍符文，2份符文布卷，2個水之精華，2份鐵網蛛絲，還有200金。",
    ["Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 5 Frozen Runes, 12 Enchanted Leather, 3 Essence of Water, 3 Cured Rugged Hides and 200 gold."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的工匠維爾海姆需要你帶給他5個冰凍符文，12塊附魔皮，3個水之精華，3塊熟化毛皮，還有200金。",
    ["Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 5 Frozen Runes, 4 Bolts of Runecloth, 2 Essences of Water, 4 Ironweb Spider Silks and 200 gold. You must also be of Exalted reputation with the Argent Dawn."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的工匠維爾海姆需要你帶給他5個冰凍符文，4份符文布卷，2個水之精華，4份鐵網蛛絲，還有200金。同時你必須在銀色黎明達到崇拜聲望值，才能完成這項任務。",
    ["Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 5 Frozen Runes, 4 Bolts of Runecloth, 4 Essences of Water, 2 Ironweb Spider Silks and 200 gold."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的工匠維爾海姆需要5個冰凍符文，4份符文布卷，4個水之精華，2份鐵網蛛絲，還有200金。",
    ["Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 8 Frozen Runes, 16 Enchanted Leathers, 5 Essences of Water, 5 Cured Rugged Hides and 300 gold. You must also be of Exalted reputation with the Argent Dawn."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的工匠維爾海姆需要你帶給他8個冰凍符文，16塊附魔皮，5個水之精華，5塊熟化毛皮，還有300金。同時你必須在銀色黎明達到崇拜聲望值，才能完成這項任務。",
    ["Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants you to bring him 2 Frozen Runes, 2 Essence of Water, 2 Blue Sapphires and 30 gold pieces."] = "將2個冰凍符文、2個水之精華、2塊藍寶石和30金幣交給東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的工匠威爾海姆。",
    ["Darren Malvew of Southshore wants you to kill 8 Mountain Lions and 10 Hulking Mountain Lions."] = "南海鎮的達倫·瑪爾維要妳殺掉8只山地獅和10只巨型山地獅。",
    ["Deathguard Samsa of Tarren Mill wants 30 Hillsbrad Human Skulls."] = "塔倫米爾的亡靈衛兵沙穆薩想要30個希爾斯布萊德人類顱骨。",
    ["Deep within the Slag Pit of the Cauldron, in the Searing Gorge, you will find the traitorous Dark Iron dwarf named Overseer Maltorius.Slay Overseer Maltorius and take his head. Return the head to Lookout Captain Lolo Longstriker in the Searing Gorge for your reward."] = "那個叫做工頭瑪托留斯的黑鐵矮人叛徒就藏在大熔爐的熔渣之池深處。  殺死工頭瑪托留斯，將他的頭顱交給灼熱峽谷的偵查隊長洛洛爾以換取妳的獎勵。",
    ["Defeat Chakuyak and bring back her pelt."] = "擊敗查庫亞並帶回牠的毛皮。",
    ["Defeat Mok'Morokk and report the news to Draz'Zilb in Brackenwall Village."] = "打敗莫格穆洛克，再把消息帶給蕨墻村的德拉茲辛比。",
    ["Defeat Morganth.Bring his Pendant of Shadow to Theocritus at the Tower of Azora in Elwynn Forest."] = "擊敗莫甘斯。  將他的陰影墜飾帶給塞歐克瑞圖斯，他就在艾爾文森林內的阿祖拉之塔中。",
    ["Defeat Zalazane.Kill 8 Voodoo Trolls and 8 Hexed Trolls.Bring Zalazane's Head to Gadrin."] = "打敗紮拉贊恩。  殺死8個巫毒巨魔和8個妖術巨魔。  把紮拉贊恩的頭顱帶給加德林大師。",
    ["Defend Daphne Stilwell from the Defias attack.Neither of your spirits must be released from their mortal coils if you wish to succeed.After you are successful, speak to Daphne Stilwell again."] = "在迪菲亞兄弟會進攻時保護達芙妮·斯迪威爾的安全。  如果妳想成功的話，妳和達芙妮都不能死在他們的劍下。",
    ["Defend Nighthaven from Eranikus. Do not let Keeper Remulos perish. Do not slay Eranikus. Defend yourself. Await Tyrande."] = "保護永夜港免受伊蘭尼庫斯的傷害。不要讓守護者雷姆洛斯死亡。不要殺掉伊蘭尼庫斯。保護好你們自己。等待泰蘭妲。",
    ["Deliver Aonda's Written Report to Valennia Stormfist in Valanaar."] = "把安妲的書面報告拿給瓦拉納爾的維菈妮雅‧颶拳。",
    ["Deliver Baros Alexston's report on the Defias Brotherhood to King Varian Wrynn in Stormwind Keep."] = "將有關迪菲亞兄弟會的報告送給暴風要塞裏的國王瓦裏安·烏瑞恩。",
    ["Deliver Trol'kalar to Zengu in Hammerfall."] = "把托卡拉爾劍交給落錘村的森古。",
    ["Deliver the Camp Mojache Zukk'ash Report to Zilzibin Drumlore. He resides in the Drag of Orgrimmar."] = "把莫沙徹營地祖卡什報告交給奧格瑞瑪暗巷區的基爾茲賓·鼓眼。",
    ["Deliver the Crystal of Zin-Malor to Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus."] = "將辛瑪洛水晶送到達納蘇斯的大德魯伊範達爾·鹿盔那裏。",
    ["Deliver the Head of Ossirian the Unscarred to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus."] = "將無疤者奧斯裏安的頭顱交給希利蘇斯塞納裏奧要塞的指揮官瑪爾利斯。",
    ["Deliver the Mysterious Relic to Vestia Moonspear in Feathermoon Stronghold."] = "將神秘遺物交給羽月要塞的維斯提亞·月矛。",
    ["Deliver the Sealed Letter to Glix Xizzix in the Undercity."] = "把密封信件交給幽暗城的吉力克斯‧希吉克斯。",
    ["Deliver the glowing crystal to Talanaanis Shadowsong in Valanaar."] = "把發光的水晶交給瓦拉納爾的塔拉尼斯‧影歌。",
    ["Denalan at Lake Al'Ameth wants you to collect the Gargantuan Tumor from Oakenscowl."] = "奧拉密斯湖的德納蘭要妳去拿到奧肯斯古爾身上的巨大的瘤。",
    ["Destroy 10 Wind Hollows in Shadowgale Forest."] = "在影風森林消滅10個風之空靈。",
    ["Destroy Razelikh the Defiler and return the Severed Horn of the Defiler to the Fallen Hero of the Horde. You will also need to return the Ward of the Defiler so that the Fallen Hero can destroy it, preventing it from ever falling into the wrong hands."] = "消滅汙染者拉瑟萊克，將汙染者之角交給部落英雄的靈魂。另外妳還要把汙染者防護結界交給他，這樣部落英雄的靈魂就可以消滅它，以避免它落入邪惡勢力之手。",
    ["Destroy the Altar of the Tides with Catelyn's Blade, kill Gazban and bring the Stone of the Tides and Catelyn's Blade back to Baron Revilgaz."] = "用凱特琳的匕首摧毀海潮祭壇，然後殺死加茲班，將海潮之石帶給大財主裏維加茲。",
    ["Destroy the Ancient Moonstone Seal at the ancient flame in Ameth'Aran, then return to Asterion in Bashal'Aran."] = "用亞米薩蘭廢墟中的遠古火焰摧毀遠古月亮石封印，然後回到巴莎蘭的阿斯特利安那裏。",
    ["Destroy the Cirrusfly Queen in Thendal Grove."] = "在坦德爾林地消滅捲雲蜂后。",
    ["Destroy the flying machine at Bael Modan and return to Gann Stonespire."] = "摧毀巴爾莫丹的飛行器，然後向加恩·石塔回復。",
    ["Dizzy One-Eye in Booty Bay wants you to retrieve his eye from the Bloodsail Buccaneers."] = "藏寶海灣的獨眼迪茲要求妳從血帆海盜那裏找回他的眼睛。",
    ["Doctor Draxlegauge in Faldir's Cove wants you to collect 10 Elven Gems and return the Goggles of Gem Hunting once you are done."] = "法迪爾海灣的德拉克裏格博士要妳去收集10塊精靈寶石並在完成任務後歸還尋寶潛水鏡。",
    ["Donova Snowden in Winterspring wants you to defeat High Chief Winterfall."] = "冬泉谷的多諾瓦·雪山要妳去擊敗冬泉酋長。",
    ["Ebru in the Wailing Caverns wants you to kill 7 Deviate Ravagers, 7 Deviate Vipers, 7 Deviate Shamblers and 7 Deviate Dreadfangs."] = "哀嚎洞穴的厄布魯要求妳殺掉7只變異破壞者、7只劇毒飛蛇、7只變異蹣跚者和7只變異尖牙風蛇。",
    ["Ensure Miran and the shipment arrive at the excavation site, then inform Prospector Ironband."] = "確保把米蘭和貨物送到挖掘場，然後通知勘察員基恩薩·鐵環。",
    ["Enter the Hall of Thanes beneath Old Ironforge and claim the Head of Durgen Dirgehammer."] = "進入舊鐵爐堡下的族長之廳，並砍下杜爾根‧戴格哈默的頭。",
    ["Eridan Bluewind in Felwood wants you to kill 8 Jadefire Hellcallers, 8 Jadefire Betrayers, 8 Jadefire Tricksters, and Xavaric. Return to Eridan when the task is completed."] = "費伍德森林的艾瑞丹·藍風要妳去殺掉8個碧火喚魔者、8個碧火背叛者、8個碧火欺詐者和薩瓦裏克。任務完成之後回到艾瑞丹那裏復命。",
    ["Escape the Furbolg cave and meet Terenthis in Auberdine."] = "離開熊怪洞穴，然後去見奧伯丁的特倫希斯。",
    ["Escort Arei to safety, then speak with Kayneth Stillwind in Forest Song, in eastern Ashenvale."] = "護送艾雷到灰谷，然後和灰谷東部的林歌神殿中的凱尼斯·靜風談壹談。",
    ["Escort Galen out of danger, then find his camp in the Swamp of Sorrows and open his strongbox."] = "護送加林逃出困境，然後打開他放在悲傷沼澤營地裏的保險箱。",
    ["Escort Kerlonian Evershade to Liladris Moonriver south along the road to find his bag in Darkshore."] = "護送克羅尼亞·恒影到灰谷邁斯特拉崗哨的利拉迪斯·月河那裏去。",
    ["Escort Kernobee to the Clockwerk Run exit and then report to Scooty in Booty Bay."] = "將克努比護送到出口，然後向藏寶海灣的斯庫提匯報。",
    ["Escort Lakota Windsong from the Darkcloud Pinnacle, and then talk to Thalia Amberhide at Freewind Post."] = "護送拉克塔·風歌離開恐怖圖騰營地，然後與亂風崗的薩利亞談壹談。",
    ["Escort Mist to Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak at the moon well near the Oracle Tree."] = "護送密斯特去神諭之樹附近的月亮井旁找哨兵阿瑞尼亞·碎雲。",
    ["Escort Taelan Fordring out of Hearthglen."] = "護送泰蘭·弗丁走出壁爐谷。",
    ["Escort Torek on his attack against Silverwing Outpost and Duriel Moonfire, then report to Ertog Ragetusk at Splintertree Post."] = "保護在銀翼哨站與杜瑞爾·月火作戰的托雷克，然後向慰籍之林的埃爾托格·怒齒匯報勝利的消息。",
    ["Escort the Gizelton Caravan through Mannoroc Coven. Talk with Smeed at Scrabblescrew's Camp for your reward."] = "護送基澤爾頓車隊通過瑪諾洛克集會所，然後與瑟卡布斯庫的營地的斯米德談壹談，領取妳的獎勵。",
    ["Executor Arren wants you to kill 10 Young Night Web Spiders and 8 Night Web Spiders."] = "執行官阿倫要妳去殺掉10只小夜行蜘蛛和8只夜行蜘蛛。",
    ["Executor Zygand in the town of Brill wants you to assassinate Captain Melrache and his two bodyguards."] = "布瑞爾的執行官塞加德要求妳刺殺麥拉其隊長及他的兩名保鏢。",
    ["Explore Frostmane Hold, and kill 5 Frostmane Headhunters for Senir Whitebeard in Kharanos."] = "偵查霜鬃巨魔要塞，替卡拉諾斯的森內爾·白須殺掉5個霜鬃獵頭者。",
    ["Far Seer Mok'thardin of Grom'gol needs Holy Spring Water. He also wants you to kill 10 Naga Explorers."] = "格羅姆高營地的先知摩克薩爾丁要妳去取回壹瓶聖泉之水，同時還要求妳殺死10名納迦探險者。",
    ["Farmer Saldean wants you to kill 20 Harvest Watchers."] = "農夫薩丁要求妳破壞掉20臺看守傀儡。",
    ["Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Bindings of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Bindings, 6 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 1 Arcane Crystal and 1 Nexus Crystal."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的神父伊尼哥·蒙托將為你製作信仰束腕，只要你幫他把下列的東西帶去:1副被褻瀆的束腕，6個受戰爭破壞的布甲碎塊，1個秘法水晶和1個聯結水晶。",
    ["Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Gloves of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Gloves, 8 Wartorn Cloth Scraps and 4 Mooncloth."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的神父伊尼哥·蒙托將為你製作信仰手套，只要你幫他把下列的東西帶去:1副被褻瀆的手套，8個受戰爭破壞的布甲碎塊和4塊月布。",
    ["Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Leggings of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Leggings, 20 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 4 Mooncloth and 2 Nexus Crystals."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的神父伊尼哥·蒙托將為你製作信仰護腿，只要你幫他把下列的東西帶去:1對被褻瀆的護腿，20個受戰爭破壞的布甲碎塊，4塊月布和2個聯結水晶。",
    ["Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Sandals of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Sandals, 12 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Mooncloth and 3 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的神父伊尼哥·蒙托將為你製作信仰便鞋，只要你幫他把下列的東西帶去:1雙被褻瀆的便鞋，12個受戰爭破壞的布甲碎塊，2塊月布和3塊熟化毛皮。",
    ["Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Shoulderpads of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Shoulderpads, 12 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Mooncloth and 3 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的神父伊尼哥·蒙托將為你製作信仰肩墊，只要你幫他把下列的東西帶去:1副被褻瀆的肩墊，12個受戰爭破壞的布甲碎塊，2塊月布和3塊熟化毛皮。",
    ["Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Belt of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Belt, 8 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Arcane Crystals and 2 Mooncloth."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的神父伊尼哥·蒙托將為你製作信仰腰帶，只要你幫他把下列的東西帶去:1條被褻瀆的腰帶，8個受戰爭破壞的布甲碎塊，2個秘法水晶和2塊月布。",
    ["Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Circlet of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Circlet, 15 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 3 Mooncloth and 3 Nexus Crystals."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的神父伊尼哥·蒙托將為你製作信仰頭環，只要你幫他把下列的東西帶去:1個被褻瀆的頭環，15個受戰爭破壞的布甲碎塊，3塊月布和3個聯結水晶。",
    ["Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Robe of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Robe, 25 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 4 Mooncloth and 2 Nexus Crystals."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的神父伊尼哥·蒙托將為你製作信仰長袍，只要你幫他把下列的東西帶去:1件被褻瀆的長袍，25個受戰爭破壞的布甲碎塊，4塊月布和2個聯結水晶。",
    ["Fight to the top of Jintha'Alor, kill Vile Priestess Hexx for the key to Sharpbeak's cage, and save Sharpbeak."] = "到辛薩羅山頂去，殺掉邪惡祭司海克斯，找到沙普比克籠子的鑰匙，然後救出沙普比克。",
    ["Fill the Coated Cerulean Vial at the orange crystal pool in Maraudon.Use the Filled Cerulean Vial on the Vylestem Vines to force the corrupted Noxxious Scion to emerge.Heal 8 plants by killing these Noxxious Scion, then return to Vark Battlescar in Shadowprey Village."] = "在瑪拉頓裏用天藍水瓶在橙色水晶池中裝滿水。  在維利斯塔姆藤蔓上使用裝滿水的天藍水瓶，使墮落的諾克賽恩幼體出現。  治療8株植物並殺死那些諾克賽恩幼體，然後向葬影村的瓦克·戰痕復命。",
    ["Fill the Empty Cleansing Bowl at the Auberdine Moonwell.Gather a sample of fruit, nut, and grain from the northern Blackwood furbolg camps.Mix the bowl and place it near the bonfire closest to the Cliffspring River at the northern camp, thus summoning the satyr corruptor.Take the Talisman of Corruption and bring it to Thundris Windweaver in Auberdine."] = "在空的凈化碗裏盛滿奧伯丁月亮井的井水。  在黑木熊怪的北部營地裏收集水果、堅果和谷物各壹份。  將水和三種食物混合起來，放置在壁泉河附近的營火邊，這樣就會召來喚引誘熊怪墮落的薩特。  取回墮落護符，將它交給奧伯丁的桑迪斯·織風。",
    ["Find 10 pieces of Soft-shelled Clam Meat and bring it back to Mai'Lahii at Shadowprey Village."] = "找到10塊軟殼蚌肉，把它們交給葬影村的麥拉斯。",
    ["Find 3 Soran'ruk Fragments and 1 Large Soran'ruk Fragment and return them to Doan Karhan in the Barrens."] = "找到3塊索蘭魯克寶珠的碎片和1塊索蘭魯克寶珠的大碎片，把它們交給貧瘠之地的杜安·卡漢。",
    ["Find Borelgore in the northern wastes of Eastern Plaguelands and destroy him. Return to Nathanos Blightcaller when the mission is complete."] = "找到東瘟疫之地北方荒原中的淤血蟲並消滅它。任務完成之後，向納薩諾斯·雕零者復命。",
    ["Find Deathguard Kel and heal his wounds using Lesser Heal (Rank 2). Afterwards, grant him Power Word: Fortitude and then return to Dark Cleric Beryl in Brill."] = "找到亡靈士兵科爾並使用次級治療術（等級 2）來治療他。然後對他施放真言術：韌，最後向布瑞爾的黑暗牧師貝裏爾復命。",
    ["Find Duskwing and slay him. From the corpse, recover a Patch of Duskwing's Fur and return it to Nathanos Blightcaller.It is said that Duskwing roams the countryside to the north of Marris Stead."] = "找到暗翼蝠並殺掉它。從屍體上取下壹塊暗翼蝠的皮，並把它交給納薩諾斯·雕零者。  據說暗翼蝠遊蕩在瑪瑞斯農場北面的荒原上。",
    ["Find Eliza's grave. Retrieve the Embalmer's Heart from her, then return to Ello Ebonlocke."] = "找到伊莉莎的墳墓，從她的身上取回藏屍者的心臟，把它交給艾爾羅·埃伯洛克。",
    ["Find Grunt Kor'ja and heal her wounds using Lesser Heal (Rank 2). Afterwards, grant her Power Word: Fortitude and then return to Tai'jin at Razor Hill."] = "找到步兵科雅，用次級治療術（等級 2）治療她，然後為她加上真言術：韌，最後向剃刀嶺的泰金復命。",
    ["Find Kor'ghan in Orgrimmar and get the Venomtail Antidote. Then bring the antidote to Rhinag near the northwestern border of Durotar."] = "找到毒尾蠍的解毒劑，把它交給杜隆塔爾西北邊境的林納格。",
    ["Find Mountaineer Dolf and heal his wounds using Lesser Heal (Rank 2). Afterwards, grant him Power Word: Fortitude and then return to Maxan Anvol in Kharanos."] = "找到巡山人多爾夫並使用次級治療術（等級 2）來治療他。然後對他施放真言術：韌，最後向卡拉諾斯的馬克薩恩·安沃爾復命。",
    ["Find Phin Odelic in Southshore."] = "到南海鎮去找到費恩·奧德利克。",
    ["Find Pilot Hildelve."] = "找到駕駛員莫裏·鐵鉆。",
    ["Find Rackmore's Silver Key. Find Rackmore's Golden Key. Find and open Rackmore's Chest."] = "找到拉克摩爾的銀鑰匙和金鑰匙。找到並打開拉克摩爾的箱子。",
    ["Find Ryedol's Lucky Pick and return it to Prospector Ryedol south of Hammertoe's Dig Site."] = "找到雷杜爾的好運鋤，把它交給鐵趾挖掘場南邊的勘察員雷杜爾。",
    ["Find Sentinel Shaya and heal her wounds using Lesser Heal (Rank 2). Afterwards, grant her Power Word: Fortitude and then return to Laurna Morninglight in Dolanaar."] = "找到哨兵莎恩雅並使用次級治療術（等級 2）來治療她。然後對她施放真言術：韌，最後向多蘭納爾的勞爾娜·晨光復命。",
    ["Find Tyrande Whisperwind in Darnassus."] = "到達納蘇斯去找到泰蘭德·語風。",
    ["Find and defeat the crocolisk Daggerfang and bring back Marek's knife."] = "尋找並擊敗鱷魚匕牙，然後帶回馬瑞可的刀子。",
    ["Find and kill \"the Collector\" then return to Marshal Dughan with The Collector's Ring."] = "找到“收貨人”並將他殺掉，然後帶著收貨人的戒指回來見治安官杜漢。",
    ["Find and return Bingles' supplies:Bingles' Wrench, Bingles' Screwdriver, Bingles' Hammer, and Bingles' Blastencapper."] = "找回賓格斯的裝備： 賓格斯的氣壓炸彈、賓格斯的扳手、賓格斯的榔頭和賓格斯的螺絲起子。",
    ["Find and return the Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass to Taskmaster Scrange in the Searing Gorge.The only information you have about these items is the following: They were definitely stolen by Dark Iron dwarves. The Smithing Tuyere is a blacksmithing tool used by blacksmiths and the Lookout's Spyglass is an invaluable monitoring tool to lookouts."] = "找到冶煉鼓風機和偵查員的望遠鏡，把它們還給灼熱峽谷的監工斯克蘭格。  妳所知道的關於這些物品的惟壹信息是：它們肯定是被黑鐵矮人偷走的。冶煉鼓風機是鐵匠用的鍛造工具，偵查員的望遠鏡是偵查員所需的偵查工具。",
    ["Find and slay a Thunderhawk, return its wings to Jorn Skyseer at Camp Taurajo."] = "找到壹只雷鷹，殺掉它，然後把它的翅膀交給陶拉祖營地的喬恩·星眼。",
    ["Find someone who knows of Ghost Howl. Provided item:."] = "去打聽打聽誰聽說過鬼嚎。",
    ["Find the 12 missing pages of the Shredder Operating Manual, and put them together to form Chapters 1, 2, and 3. Return the pages to Gurda Ragescar near Splintertree Post."] = "找到丟失的12頁伐木機操作指南，把它們合並為第1、2、3章。然後帶著這些書頁回到碎木崗哨去找古爾達·怒痕。",
    ["Find the author of the message in a bottle."] = "找到瓶中信的作者。",
    ["Find what awaits you."] = "找出等待著你的事物。",
    ["First Mate Nilzlix wants you to retrieve the Charts and Logs from the Maiden's Folly and the Spirit of Silverpine."] = "大副尼茲利克斯讓妳從處女號和銀松之魂號中取回航海圖和航海日誌。",
    ["Follow Donova Snowden's instructions, then report back."] = "根據多諾瓦·雪山的指示行動，然後回到她那裏報告。",
    ["For 110 Insignias of the Dawn and 110 Insignias of the Crusade you may choose an item from the Argent Dawn's treasure cache."] = "付出110個黎明徽記和110個十字軍徽記就能換取銀色黎明藏寶庫裡的一樣史詩級的物品。",
    ["For 30 Insignias of the Dawn and 30 Insignias of the Crusade you may choose an item from the Argent Dawn's treasure cache."] = "付出30個黎明徽記和30個十字軍徽記就能換取銀色黎明藏寶庫裡的一樣強大的物品。",
    ["Gar'Thok of Razor Hill wants you to retrieve 3 Gnomish Tools from the wreckage off the coast."] = "剃刀嶺的加索克要妳從海岸邊的艦隊殘骸中打撈出3件侏儒的工具。",
    ["Gather 5 Intact Raptor Horns from Sunscale Scytheclaws, and bring them to Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet."] = "從赤鱗鐮爪龍身上收集5根完整的迅猛龍角，把它們交給棘齒城的米希瑞克斯。",
    ["Gather 5 Notched Ribs and 3 Blackened Skulls, then return to Deathguard Dillinger in Brill."] = "收集5根鋸齒肋骨和3個焦黑的顱骨，然後向布瑞爾的亡靈衛兵迪林格爾回報。",
    ["Gather 6 Underbelly Whelp Scales from Black Dragon Whelps, and bring them to Verner Osgood in Redridge."] = "從黑龍雛龍身上收集6片雛龍的腹鱗，把它們交給赤脊山的弗納·奧斯古。",
    ["Gather 7 Lowlands Galestrider Tenderloins from the Ornery Galestriders found throughout the Gustberry Lowlands."] = "從風莓低地各處的暴躁的逐風者身上收集7個低地逐風者腰肉。",
    ["Gather Searing Collars from the cultists in Skull Rock.Bring them to Margoz at his camp."] = "在骷髏石中的火刃祭司身上收集灼熱項圈，  然後交給瑪高茲。",
    ["Gershala Nightwhisper in Auberdine wants 8 Corrupt Brain stems."] = "奧伯丁的戈沙拉·夜語需要8塊墮落者的腦幹。",
    ["Get 10 Scorpid Worker Tails for Gornek in the Den."] = "給大獸穴中的高內克帶回10根工蠍的尾巴。",
    ["Get 5 pieces of Crocolisk Meat and 6 Crocolisk Skins for Marek Ironheart at the Farstrider Lodge."] = "收集5塊鱷魚肉和6張鱷魚皮，把它們交給旅行者營地裏的馬雷克·鐵心。",
    ["Get 7 pieces of Scrap Metal for Sigrun."] = "幫西格魯收集7塊金屬碎片。",
    ["Get the Book of the Ancients and return it to Azore Aldamort at the tower in Ethel Rethor."] = "拿到上古之書，將其交給艾瑟雷索塔中的阿佐爾·奧達蒙特。",
    ["Get the mysterious ore from Piznik after he finishes mining it."] = "在匹茲尼克完成開采之後拿到神秘礦石。",
    ["Give Deliana your Helm of Valor and Breastplate of Valor."] = "將你的勇氣頭盔和勇氣胸甲交給德莉娜。",
    ["Give Marshal Maxwell the bad news."] = "把這個壞消息傳達給麥克斯韋爾元帥。",
    ["Give Sara Timberlain the Stormwind Armor Marker."] = "把暴風城護甲標記交給薩拉·迪博雷恩。",
    ["Give the cask of Evershine to Pilot Bellowfiz at Steelgrill's Depot."] = "把這桶艾沃沙酒交給鋼架補給站的駕駛員貝隆·風箱。",
    ["Go to the Shards of Myzrael, summon her and defeat her.Gather her Eldritch Shackles and bind them to the Shards of Myzrael."] = "到密斯萊爾水晶碎塊去召喚她，然後打敗她。  搜出她身上的怪異鐐銬，將其和密斯萊爾水晶碎塊縛在壹起。",
    ["Go with Ogron to speak with Reethe, then return to Krog in Brackenwall Village."] = "和奧格隆壹起去和雷瑟談壹談，然後回到蕨墻村見克羅格。",
    ["Grab a Flawed Power Stone. Bring it to the Altar of Fire before the stone expires, then return to Ak'Zeloth."] = "取壹塊有瑕疵的能量石。在能量石失去魔法之前把它帶到火焰祭壇去，然後向雅克塞羅斯復命。",
    ["Grazle wants you to prove yourself by killing 5 Deadwood Warriors, 5 Deadwood Pathfinders, and 5 Deadwood Gardeners."] = "格拉茲要妳去殺死6個死木戰士、6個死木探路者以及6個死木園丁。",
    ["Grelin Whitebeard wants you to kill Grik'nir the Cold, and retrieve his journal."] = "格瑞林·白須要妳去殺掉冷酷的格瑞克尼爾，並取回他的日記。",
    ["Grelin Whitebeard would like you to kill 14 Frostmane Troll Whelps."] = "格瑞林·白須要妳去殺掉14個霜鬃巨魔幼崽。",
    ["Grull Hawkwind in Camp Narache wants you to bring him 10 Mountain Cougar Pelts."] = "納拉其營地的格魯爾·鷹風要求妳帶給他10張山獅皮。",
    ["Grull Hawkwind in Camp Narache wants you to bring him 7 Plainstrider Feathers and 7 pieces of Plainstrider Meat."] = "納拉其營地的格魯爾·鷹風要求妳帶給他7片平原陸行鳥的羽毛和7塊平原陸行鳥肉。",
    ["Grull Hawkwind in Camp Narache wants you to kill Battleboars and bring back 8 Battleboar Snouts and 8 Battleboar Flanks."] = "納拉其營地的格魯爾·鷹風要求妳去幹掉鬥豬，並帶給他4塊鬥豬頭和4塊鬥豬肋排。",
    ["Hansel Heavyhands wants you to kill 20 Greater Lava Spiders in the Searing Gorge. You can find Greater Lava Spiders in the plateaus and lava pools of the Searing Gorge.Return to Hansel Heavyhands in the Searing Gorge when you have killed enough Greater Lava Spiders."] = "漢瑟爾·重拳要妳殺死灼熱峽谷中的20只巨型熔巖蜘蛛。妳可以在灼熱峽谷的高地和熔巖池裏找到巨型熔巖蜘蛛。  當妳殺死足夠的巨型熔巖蜘蛛之後，回到漢瑟爾·重拳那裏復命。",
    ["Hansel Heavyhands wants you to kill 20 Heavy War Golems.The Heavy War Golems wander the areas surrounding the Cauldron in the Searing Gorge. When you've killed enough, return to Hansel in Searing Gorge."] = "漢瑟爾·重拳讓妳殺掉20個重型作戰傀儡。  重型作戰傀儡就在灼熱峽谷的大熔爐附近。當妳殺死足夠多的傀儡後，就回去找漢瑟爾·重拳。",
    ["Hear Zamael tell his tale."] = "聽薩麥爾講述他的故事。",
    ["Help Deathstalker Faerleia kill the Pyrewood Council."] = "幫助亡靈哨兵費雷亞消滅焚木村議會。",
    ["Help Marshal Windsor get his gear back and free his friends. Return to Marshal Maxwell if you succeed."] = "幫助溫德索爾元帥拿回他的裝備並救出他的朋友。當妳成功之後就回去向麥克斯韋爾元帥復命。",
    ["Help Pal'juh escape Kolkar Crag and bring news of your success to Master Vornal in Sen'jin Village."] = "協助帕朱逃離科卡爾峭壁，並將成功的消息告訴森金村的沃納爾大師。",
    ["Help Sentinel Lynessa Duskblossom escape Ban'ethil Barrow Den, and report her is safety to Sentinel Kyra Starsong in Dolanaar."] = "幫助哨兵莉妮莎‧暮花逃離班奈希爾獸穴，並向多蘭納爾的哨兵凱拉‧星歌回報她安全的消息。",
    ["Help Walton survive the encounter with Terry Longdrink and the Kul Tiras marines."] = "協助瓦爾頓挺過泰瑞‧朗德瑞克和庫爾提拉斯海軍的突襲。",
    ["Hemet Nesingwary wants you to bring him the head of King Bangalash, the great white tiger."] = "赫米特·奈辛瓦裏要求妳將虎王邦加拉什的頭帶回來給他。",
    ["Hemet Nesingwary wants you to kill Tethis, an elusive, dangerous raptor in Stranglethorn."] = "赫米特·奈辛瓦裏要求妳殺死荊棘谷中最危險最狡猾的迅猛龍泰希斯。",
    ["High Executor Darthalia of Tarren Mill is offering a bounty on Clerk Horrace Whitesteed, Citizen Wilkes, Miner Hackett and Farmer Kalaba."] = "塔倫米爾的高級執行官達薩利亞懸賞通緝書記員赫拉斯·懷特斯蒂德、平民維爾克斯、礦工哈克特和農夫卡拉巴。",
    ["Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Cryptstalker Boots if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Boots, 12 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 3 Nexus Crystals."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的獵人里歐波將為你製作地穴行者長靴，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1雙被褻瀆的長靴，12個受戰爭破壞的鍊甲碎塊，1個奧金錠和3個聯結水晶。",
    ["Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Cryptstalker Handguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Handguards, 8 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 5 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的獵人里歐波將為你製作地穴行者手甲，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1對被褻瀆的手甲，8個受戰爭破壞的鍊甲碎塊，1個奧金錠和5塊熟化毛皮。",
    ["Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Cryptstalker Legguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Legguards, 20 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 3 Arcanite Bars and 5 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的獵人里歐波將為你製作地穴行者腿甲，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1對被褻瀆的腿甲，20個受戰爭破壞的鍊甲碎塊，3個奧金錠和5塊熟化毛皮。",
    ["Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Cryptstalker Spaulders if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Spaulders, 12 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 2 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的獵人里歐波將為你製作地穴行者肩甲，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1對被褻瀆的肩甲，12個受戰爭破壞的鍊甲碎塊，2個奧金錠和3塊熟化毛皮。",
    ["Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Cryptstalker Wristguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Wristguards, 6 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 2 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的獵人里歐波將為你製作地穴行者腕甲，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1對被褻瀆的束腕，6個受戰爭破壞的鍊甲碎塊，1個奧金錠和2塊熟化毛皮。",
    ["Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Cryptstalker Girdle if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Girdle, 8 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 3 Nexus Crystals."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的獵人里歐波將為你製作地穴行者束腰，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1個被褻瀆的束腰，8個受戰爭破壞的鍊甲碎塊，1個奧金錠和3個聯結水晶。",
    ["Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Cryptstalker Headpiece if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Headpiece, 15 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 2 Nexus Crystals."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的獵人里歐波將為你製作地穴行者首盔，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1個被褻瀆的首盔，15個受戰爭破壞的鍊甲碎塊，4個奧金錠和2個聯結水晶。",
    ["Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Cryptstalker Tunic if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Tunic, 25 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的獵人里歐波將為你製作地穴行者外套，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1件被褻瀆的外套，25個受戰爭破壞的鍊甲碎塊，4個奧金錠和3塊熟化毛皮。",
    ["Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to recover his twin brother's remains. Find and return Huntsman Malkhor's Skull and Huntsman Malkhor's Bones to Huntsman Markhor.Markhor mentioned that his brother's remains were fed to the oozes and wolves of the Vilebranch. He also mentioned that there is a refuse pit filled with oozes in Jintha'alor as well as a wolf den. Both of these places are near the top of the temple."] = "辛特蘭惡齒村的獵戶馬克霍爾要妳去找回他的雙胞胎兄弟的屍體。找到它，然後把獵戶莫克霍爾的頭顱和獵戶莫克霍爾的骨頭交給獵戶馬克霍爾。  馬克霍爾說過，他兄弟的屍體被軟泥怪和邪枝巨魔的狼群分食。他還提到在辛薩羅有個大坑，裏面全都是軟泥怪，那裏還有個狼穴。這兩個地方都在靠近辛薩羅神廟頂部的區域。",
    ["Investigate the disappearance of Edward Heartweaver in the Ruins of Lordaeron."] = "在羅德隆廢墟調查愛德華‧織心者為什麼會失蹤。",
    ["Kill 10 Boulderfist Brutes and 4 Boulderfist Magi, and return to Drum Fel in the Hammerfall outpost."] = "殺死10個石拳蠻兵和4個石拳法師，然後向落錘村哨所的杜拉姆法爾復命。",
    ["Kill 10 Highlands Bandits and their leader, \"Badwind\" Bennic in the Shen'dar Highlands."] = "在申德高地殺死10個高地強盜和他們的首領『惡風』班尼克。",
    ["Kill 10 Marsh Murlocs, 10 Marsh Inkspewer, and 10 Marsh Flesheater, then return to Katar in the Swamp of Sorrows."] = "殺掉10個沼澤魚人、10個沼澤噴墨魚人和10個沼澤食腐魚人，然後向悲傷沼澤的卡塔爾回報。",
    ["Kill 10 Mottled Boars then return to Gornek at the Den."] = "殺掉10只雜斑野豬，然後向大獸穴裏的高內克報告。",
    ["Kill 10 Pterrordax and 15 Frenzied Pterrordax, then speak to Spraggle Frock at Marshal's Refuge."] = "殺掉10只翼手龍和15只狂怒的翼手龍，然後向馬紹爾營地的斯普拉格·弗勞克報告。",
    ["Kill 10 Syndicate Rogues and 10 Syndicate Watchmen. Return to High Executor Darthalia in Tarren Mill for your reward."] = "殺死10個辛迪加潛行者和10個辛迪加哨兵，然後回到塔倫米爾向高級執行官達薩利亞報告。",
    ["Kill 12 Dustwind Savages and 8 Dustwind Storm Witches for Rezlak near Drygulch Ravine."] = "為奧格瑞瑪附近的雷茲拉克殺掉12個塵風暴徒和8個塵風雷巫。",
    ["Kill 12 Fen Creepers, then return to Rethiel the Greenwarden in the Wetlands."] = "殺死12只沼澤爬行者，然後向濕地的綠色守衛者雷希耶爾復命。",
    ["Kill 12 Kobold Laborers, then return to Marshal McBride at Northshire Abbey."] = "殺死12只狗頭人苦力，然後向北郡修道院裏的治安官瑪克布萊德復命。",
    ["Kill 12 Rattlecage Skeletons, and then return to Shadow Priest Sarvis in Deathknell when you are done."] = "殺掉12個斷骨骷髏，然後回到喪鐘鎮的暗影牧師薩維斯那裏。",
    ["Kill 12 Syndicate Footpads and 8 Syndicate Thieves, then return to Magistrate Henry Maleb in Southshore."] = "殺死12個辛迪加劫匪和8個辛迪加潛行者，然後回到南海鎮向赫尼·馬雷布鎮長報到。",
    ["Kill 12 Vile Familiars.Return to Zureetha Fargaze outside the Den."] = "殺死12只邪靈劣魔，然後向大獸穴外的祖雷薩復命。",
    ["Kill 14 Crushridge Maulers for Melisara in Tarren Mill."] = "塔倫米爾的梅裏薩拉要妳去殺掉14個破碎嶺虐待者。",
    ["Kill 15 Enraged Apparitions, 10 Tormented Souls and put the spirit of Anvilmar to rest."] = "殺死15個狂怒的亡魂和10個痛苦的靈魂，讓安威瑪的靈魂能夠安息。",
    ["Kill 15 Pygmy Venom Web Spiders, and then report back to Watcher Dodds in Duskwood."] = "守夜人道茨要妳殺15只小型結網毒蜘蛛。",
    ["Kill 5 Elder Mountain Boars and return to Daryl the Youngling in the Farstrider Lodge within 12 minutes."] = "殺掉5只老山豬，然後回到旅行者營地去見年輕的達瑞爾，時限為12分鐘。",
    ["Kill 6 Kurzen Elite, 4 Kurzen Subchiefs, and bring Kurzen's Head to Lieutenant Doren at the Rebel Camp."] = "殺掉6名庫爾森精英和4名庫爾森副首領，並將庫爾森的頭顱交給反抗軍營地裏的多倫上尉。",
    ["Kill 6 Mountain Buzzards and return to Daryl the Youngling in the Farstrider Lodge within 15 minutes."] = "殺死6只山鷲，然後回到旅行者營地見年輕的達瑞爾，時限為15分鐘。",
    ["Kill 7 Deviate Ravagers, 7 Deviate Vipers, 7 Deviate Shamblers and 7 Deviate Dreadfangs. Ebru offers a choice of Pattern: Deviate Scale Belt, Sizzle Stick, or Dagmire Gauntlets. The belt is crafted afterwards."] = "哀嚎洞穴的厄布魯要求妳殺掉7只變異破壞者、7只劇毒飛蛇、7只變異蹣跚者和7只變異尖牙風蛇。",
    ["Kill 7 Young Nightsabers and 4 Young Thistle Boars and return to Conservator Ilthalaine."] = "殺死7只夜刃豹幼崽和4只草刺野豬幼崽，然後向管理員伊爾薩萊恩復命。",
    ["Kill 8 Befouled Webwoods and bring Xethorr the Wicked's Mature Fel Moss to Tallonkai Swiftroot in Dolanaar."] = "殺死8個被污染的網木，然後把邪惡的希索爾的成熟魔苔交給多蘭納爾的塔隆凱·捷根。",
    ["Kill 8 Razormane Geomancers, 8 Razormane Defenders, and Kreenig Snarlsnout.Then bring Kreenig Snarlsnout's Tusk to Thork at the Crossroads."] = "殺掉8個鋼鬃地蔔師、8個鋼鬃防禦者和他們的頭目克裏尼格·糟鼻。  把克裏尼格·糟鼻的獠牙交給十字路口的索克。",
    ["Kill 8 Wailing Ancestors and 8 Rotting Ancestors.Kill Captain Dargol, and bring his skull to Magistrate Sevren in Brill."] = "殺死8個哀嚎的鬼魂和8個腐爛的古屍。  消滅達高爾隊長，並將他的顱骨交給布瑞爾的執政官塞弗倫。",
    ["Kill Ambassador Infernus in Angor Fortress and bring proof of his death to Advisor Belgrum in Ironforge."] = "殺死苦痛堡壘中的因弗努斯大使，把證明他已死亡的信物交給鐵爐堡的顧問貝爾格拉姆。",
    ["Kill Balgaras the Foul and bring his ear to Longbraid the Grim outside of Dun Modr."] = "殺死邪惡的巴爾加拉斯，把他的耳朵帶給丹莫德外的布萊德·長須。",
    ["Kill Bazzalan and Jergosh the Invoker before returning to Thrall in Orgrimmar."] = "殺死巴紮蘭和祈求者耶戈什，然後回到奧格瑞瑪的薩爾那裏。",
    ["Kill Besseleth and bring Besseleth's Fang to Maggran at Sun Rock Retreat."] = "殺掉貝瑟萊斯，然後把貝瑟萊斯的牙齒交給烈日石居的馬格蘭。",
    ["Kill Bristlebacks in Brambleblade Ravine and bring 12 Bristleback Belts to Chief Hawkwind in Camp Narache."] = "殺掉刺刃峽谷的刺背野豬人並帶回12條刺背腰帶，把它們交給納拉其營地的鷹風酋長。",
    ["Kill Chieftain Nek'roshBring Nek'rosh's Head to Captain Stoutfist."] = "殺掉納克羅什酋長。  將納克羅什的頭顱交給斯托菲隊長。",
    ["Kill Garrick Padfoot and bring his head to Deputy Willem at Northshire Abbey."] = "殺死加瑞克·帕德弗特，帶著他的頭到北郡修道院去找維裏副隊長。",
    ["Kill Geltharis and return the Branch of Cenarius to Illiyana at the Shrine of Aessina."] = "殺掉加薩裏斯，把塞納留斯的樹枝交給艾森娜神殿的伊莉亞娜。",
    ["Kill High Inquisitor Whitemane, Scarlet Commander Mograine, Herod, the Scarlet Champion and Houndmaster Loksey and then report back to Raleigh the Devout in Southshore."] = "殺死大檢察官懷特邁恩，血色十字軍指揮官莫格萊尼，十字軍的勇士赫洛德和馴犬者洛克希並向南海鎮的萊雷恩復命。",
    ["Kill Infiltrator Hameya. Use his key on the Mound of Dirt behind the Undercroft."] = "殺了滲透者哈米亞，用他的鑰匙開啟墓室後的壹堆泥土。",
    ["Kill Ivar the Foul, and bring Ivar's Head to Rane Yorick at the Ivar Patch."] = "殺死邪惡的伊瓦，並將伊瓦的頭顱帶給伊瓦農莊的蘭妮·尤瑞克。",
    ["Kill Mangeclaw.Bring his Mangy Claw and Hildelve's Journal to Pilot Hammerfoot."] = "殺死癩爪。  把它的骯臟的爪子和莫裏·鐵鉆的日記交給駕駛員塞克·錘足。",
    ["Kill Meven Korgal, the messenger, at the Crusader camp, then return any information you find to Executor Arren."] = "到十字軍營地去殺掉信使邁文·考加爾，將妳發現的情報交給執行官阿倫。",
    ["Kill Moora and Salia, and bring Shadow Lord Fel'dan's Head to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood."] = "殺掉米萊恩和薩莉亞，並把暗影領主費爾丹的頭顱交給費伍德森林的格雷塔·苔蹄。",
    ["Kill Rath'mael in the Ruins of Lordaeron for Deathguard Kristof in Brill."] = "為布瑞爾的亡靈衛兵克里斯多夫殺死羅德隆廢墟的拉斯梅爾。",
    ["Kill Rot Hide Graverobbers and Rot Hide Mongrels. Bring 8 Embalming Ichors to Magistrate Sevren in Brill."] = "殺死腐皮盜墓賊和混血腐皮豺狼人。  給布瑞爾的執政官塞弗倫帶回8瓶防腐劑。",
    ["Kill Sarkoth and bring his claw back to Hana'zua."] = "殺死薩科斯並將它的爪子帶回去交給哈納祖。",
    ["Kill Stalvan Mistmantle and show Madame Eva his family ring."] = "幹掉斯塔文·密斯特曼托，把他的家族戒指帶給伊瓦夫人看看。",
    ["Kill Supervisor Fizsprocket and return his clipboard to Morin Cloudstalker at Bloodhoof Village."] = "殺掉菲茲普羅克主管，把他的筆記板帶給血蹄村的摩林·雲行者。",
    ["Kill Tazan and bring his Satchel to Therzok in the Cleft of Shadow in Orgrimmar."] = "殺死塔贊，把他的背包帶給奧格瑞瑪暗影裂口的瑟祖克。",
    ["Kill Ursal the Mauler and return to Athridas Bearmantle in Dolanaar."] = "殺掉大槌烏薩爾，然後回到多蘭納爾的阿斯瑞達斯·熊皮那裏。",
    ["Kill Valdred Moray.Bring his hands to Raleigh Andrean in the Undercity."] = "殺掉瓦德雷·莫萊。  把他的雙手帶給幽暗城的拉林夫·安迪恩。",
    ["Kill Vulgara the Insatiable in the Shen'dar Highlands and bring her head to Danarii Bellowveil."] = "在申德高地殺死『貪食者』弗加拉，並將她的頭顱帶給達納里‧吼幕。",
    ["Kill rot hide gnolls at the Dead Fields.When Nightlash appears, kill her.Bring the Essence of Nightlash to High Executor Hadrec at the Sepulcher."] = "清剿亡者農場的腐皮豺狼人。  當奈塔拉什出現時，把她也殺掉。  將奈塔拉什的靈魂帶給瑟伯切爾的高級執行官哈德瑞克。",
    ["Kill the Dalaran archmage, then retrieve his staff for Shadow Priest Allister at the Sepulcher."] = "殺死達拉然大法師，並把他的法杖交給瑟伯切爾的暗影牧師奧利斯特。",
    ["Kill the Trogg leader, Grawmug, and his two guards, Gnasher and Brawler then report back to Captain Rugelfuss in the southern guard tower."] = "殺掉穴居人首領格勞姆格及他的兩個護衛，納什爾和布勞勒爾。然後回到南部警戒塔向拉格弗斯上尉報告。",
    ["Kill the druids: Taneel Darkwood, Uthil Mooncall, Mavoris Cloudsbreak; then return to Kayneth Stillwind in Forest Song."] = "殺死這些德魯伊：坦尼爾·黑木、尤希爾·喚月和瑪沃裏斯·裂雲，然後向慰藉之林中的凱尼斯·靜風復命。",
    ["Kill the group of Shadow Silk Poachers that wander the Searing Gorge. Nilith has reason to believe that there are five of them that need to be exterminated. Return to Nilith in the Searing Gorge when this task is complete."] = "殺死在灼熱峽谷遊蕩的暗影蛛絲偷獵者小隊。尼莉絲認為他們共有5名成員，妳的任務就是把他們全都幹掉。",
    ["Kill the leader of the Talon Den, Rynthariel the Keymaster."] = "殺死猛禽洞穴的領袖琳薩瑞爾。",
    ["Kill the sea giant along Durotar's north coast and bring back proof of your accomplishment."] = "殺死杜洛塔北海岸的海巨人，並帶回你成功的證明。",
    ["Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreadnaught Bracers if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Bracers, 6 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 1 Nexus Crystal."] = "如果妳將1副被玷汙的護腕、6塊板甲碎片、1塊奧金錠和1塊連結水晶交給東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的科爾法克斯，他會為妳制作壹副無畏護腕。",
    ["Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreadnaught Gauntlets if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Gauntlets, 8 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 5 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果妳將1副被玷汙的護手、8塊板甲碎片、1塊奧金錠和5個熟化毛皮交給東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的科爾法克斯，他會為妳制作壹副無畏護手。",
    ["Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreadnaught Legplates if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Legplates, 20 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果妳將1副被玷汙的腿鎧、20塊板甲碎片、4塊奧金錠和3個熟化毛皮交給東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的科爾法克斯，他會為妳制作壹副無畏腿鎧。",
    ["Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreadnaught Pauldrons if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Pauldrons, 12 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 2 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果妳將1副被玷汙的肩鎧、12塊板甲碎片、2塊奧金錠和3個熟化毛皮交給東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的科爾法克斯，他會為妳制作壹副無畏肩鎧。",
    ["Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreadnaught Sabatons if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Sabatons, 12 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 2 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果妳將1雙被玷汙的馬靴、12塊板甲碎片、2塊奧金錠和3個熟化毛皮交給東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的科爾法克斯，他會為妳制作壹雙無畏馬靴。",
    ["Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Dreadnaught Breastplate if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Breastplate, 25 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 2 Nexus Crystals."] = "如果妳將1件被玷汙的胸甲、25塊板甲碎片、4塊奧金錠和2塊連結水晶交給東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的科爾法克斯，他會為妳制作壹件無畏胸甲。",
    ["Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Dreadnaught Helmet if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Helmet, 15 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 5 Arcanite Bars and 1 Nexus Crystal."] = "如果妳將1頂被玷汙的頭盔、15塊板甲碎片、5塊奧金錠和1塊連結水晶交給東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的科爾法克斯，他會為妳制作壹頂無畏頭盔。",
    ["Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Dreadnaught Waistguard if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Waistguard, 8 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 5 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果妳將1條被玷汙的護腰、8塊板甲碎片、1塊奧金錠和5個熟化毛皮交給東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的科爾法克斯，他會為妳制作壹條無畏護腰。",
    ["Krusk in Tarren Mill needs you to free Drull and Tog'thar from Durnholde Keep."] = "塔倫米爾的克魯斯克要妳把德魯爾和托格薩從敦霍爾德城堡救出來。",
    ["Lar Prowltusk outside of Sen'jin Village wants you to destroy the 3 sets of Attack Plans held within Kolkar Crag."] = "在森金村外面的拉爾·獵齒要求妳粉碎科卡爾峭壁內的三份進攻計劃。",
    ["Lead Ringo to Spraggle Frock at Marshal's Refuge.If Ringo faints, use Spraggle's Canteen to revive him."] = "把林格帶回馬紹爾營地的斯普拉格·弗勞克身邊。  如果林格暈倒了，就用斯普拉格的水壺讓他恢復。",
    ["Locate Beren's Peril, then kill 6 Ravenclaw Drudgers and 6 Ravenclaw Guardians, then return to Shadow Priest Allister at the Sepulcher."] = "找到博倫的巢穴，殺死6名鴉爪苦工和6名鴉爪守護者，然後向瑟伯切爾的暗影牧師奧利斯特匯報。",
    ["Locate Captain Sanders' chest and open it for your reward. Provided item:."] = "找到杉德爾船長的箱子並打開它，取得妳的獎勵。",
    ["Locate Zzarc'Vul in the southern ogre mound in Duskwood and return his monocle to Viktori in Darkshire."] = "在暮色森林南部的食人魔土丘上找到紮克烏爾，把他的單片眼鏡帶回夜色鎮交給維克托。",
    ["Locate and retrieve the three Secret Notes in Darkcloud Pinnacle."] = "在黑雲峰拿到三封密信。",
    ["Look around Falaath Village to learn about the cult's intentions in the Shen'dar Highlands."] = "在申德高地的法拉斯村四處看看，得知邪教的意圖。",
    ["Maggran at Sun Rock Retreat wishes you to slay Bloodfury Ripper and bring her remains as proof of your deed."] = "烈日石居的馬格蘭要妳去殺掉血怒撕裂者，然後把她的遺體帶回來作為證據。",
    ["Maintain your reputation with the Gelkis, and bring the Maraudine Key Fragment to Uthek the Wise in the Gelkis Village."] = "繼續和吉爾吉斯部族保持良好的關系，把瑪洛迪鑰匙碎片交給吉爾吉斯村的智者烏泰克。",
    ["Marvon Rivetseeker in Tanaris wants you to collect 30 Gahz'ridian Ornaments."] = "塔納利斯的瑪爾馮·瑞文斯克要妳收集30件加茲瑞迪安飾物。",
    ["Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Plagueheart Bindings if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Bindings, 6 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 1 Arcane Crystal and 1 Nexus Crystal."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的『施怒者』麥特斯將為你製作瘟疫之心束腕，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1對被褻瀆的束腕，6個受戰爭破壞的布甲碎塊，1個秘法水晶和1個聯結水晶。",
    ["Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Plagueheart Gloves if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Gloves, 8 Wartorn Cloth Scraps and 4 Mooncloth."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的『施怒者』麥特斯將為你製作瘟疫之心手套，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1副被褻瀆的手套，8個受戰爭破壞的布甲碎塊和4塊月布。",
    ["Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Plagueheart Leggings if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Leggings, 20 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 4 Mooncloth and 2 Nexus Crystals."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的『施怒者』麥特斯將為你製作瘟疫之心護腿，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1對被褻瀆的護腿，20個受戰爭破壞的布甲碎塊，4塊月布和2個聯結水晶。",
    ["Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Plagueheart Sandals if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Sandals, 12 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Mooncloth and 3 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的『施怒者』麥特斯將為你製作瘟疫之心便鞋，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1雙被褻瀆的便鞋，12個受戰爭破壞的布甲碎塊，2塊月布和3塊熟化毛皮。",
    ["Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Plagueheart Shoulderpads if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Shoulderpads, 12 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Mooncloth and 3 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的『施怒者』麥特斯將為你製作瘟疫之心肩墊，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1副被褻瀆的肩墊，12個受戰爭破壞的布甲碎塊，2塊月布和3塊熟化毛皮。",
    ["Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Plagueheart Belt if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Belt, 8 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Arcane Crystals and 2 Mooncloth."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的『施怒者』麥特斯將為你製作瘟疫之心腰帶，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1條被褻瀆的腰帶，8個受戰爭破壞的布甲碎塊，2個秘法水晶和2塊月布。",
    ["Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Plagueheart Circlet if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Circlet, 15 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 3 Mooncloth and 3 Nexus Crystals."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的『施怒者』麥特斯將為你製作瘟疫之心頭環，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1個被褻瀆的頭環，15個受戰爭破壞的布甲碎塊，3塊月布和3個聯結水晶。",
    ["Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Plagueheart Robe if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Robe, 25 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 4 Mooncloth and 2 Nexus Crystals."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的『施怒者』麥特斯將為你製作瘟疫之心長袍，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1件被褻瀆的長袍，25個受戰爭破壞的布甲碎塊，4塊月布和2個聯結水晶。",
    ["Motley Garmason wants Kam Deepfury's head brought to him at Dun Modr."] = "丹莫德的莫特雷·加瑪森要求妳把卡姆·深怒的頭顱交給他。",
    ["Mudcrush Durtfeet in northern Dustwallow wants 12 Mirefin Heads."] = "塵泥沼澤北部的馬德克拉什要妳去抓12條泥鰭小魚。",
    ["Novice Elreth requires 6 Scavenger Paws and 6 Duskbat Wings."] = "新兵艾爾雷斯需要6只食腐狼的爪子和6只夜行蝙蝠翼。",
    ["Oben Rageclaw wants you to kill his soulless body, and then use the Voodoo Charm."] = "奧本·怒爪要求妳去殺掉他那失去靈魂的身體，然後對其屍體使用巫毒咒符。",
    ["Open the Resonite cask with the Enchanted Resonite Crystal, and then slay Goggeroc. Return to Mor'rogal with the news and Enchanted Resonite Crystal."] = "使用魔化共鳴水晶打開共鳴桶，然後殺死高戈羅克。將這個消息告訴摩羅加爾，並把魔化共鳴水晶還給他。",
    ["Open the chest and claim your reward."] = "打開箱子，取走妳的酬勞。",
    ["Ormer Ironbraid at the Whelgar Excavation Site wants you to kill Sarltooth and return to him with one of his talons once the task is fulfilled."] = "維爾加挖掘場的奧莫爾·鐵衣要求妳殺死薩爾圖斯，並在任務完成之後帶著它的壹只爪子向他復命。",
    ["Orwin Gizzmick in Camp Mojache wants 12 samples of Gordunni Cobalt."] = "莫沙徹營地的奧爾文·吉茲米克需要12塊戈杜尼鈷礦石的樣本。",
    ["Otho Moji'ko at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to travel to Aerie Peak in the western region of the Hinterlands and place the Final Message to the Wildhammer by the well in the center of town. Return to him once this task is complete.Beware of angry Wildhammer dwarves and unruly members of the Alliance."] = "辛特蘭惡齒村的奧索·莫吉克要妳去辛特蘭西部的鷹巢山，把給蠻錘部族的警告插在城鎮中心的水井旁邊。任務完成之後回到他那裏去復命。  當心那些憤怒的蠻錘矮人以及野蠻的聯盟成員。",
    ["Overlord Mok'Morokk in Brackenwall Village wants you to retrieve his grog, snuff and strongbox in Dustwallow Swamp."] = "蕨墻村的莫格穆洛克大王要妳從石槌廢墟拿回他的烈酒、鼻煙和保險箱。",
    ["Pick up Shay's Bell from the chest.Escort Shay Leafrunner to Rockbiter's camp."] = "從箱子裏拿取沙恩的鈴鐺，然後護送沙恩·飄葉回到羅克比特的營地。",
    ["Place Karang's Banner on the Foulweald Totem Mound. Do not let the furbolgs destroy the banner. Defeat Chief Murgut and bring Murgut's Totem to Karang Amakkar at Zoram'gar."] = "把卡拉恩的旗子插到汙林圖騰堆中。不要讓熊怪摧毀這面旗子。擊敗穆戈特酋長，將穆戈特的圖騰交給佐拉姆加的卡拉恩·阿瑪卡。",
    ["Plant 10 Gaea Seeds in Gaea Dirt Mounds, and then return the remaining Enchanted Gaea Seeds to Tammra at Sun Rock Retreat."] = "將10枚蓋亞之種種植在蓋亞土堆中，然後與烈日石居的塔姆拉談壹談。",
    ["Priestess A'moora wants you to place Lady Sathrah's silvery spinnerets at the fountain inside the temple, and then return to her."] = "女祭司艾茉拉讓妳將薩絲拉的銀色絲囊放在大殿的噴泉處，然後回去見她。",
    ["Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to recover 10 Vessels of Tainted Blood from Jintha'alor. Return to Primal Torntusk when this task is complete."] = "辛特蘭惡齒村的斷齒族長要妳在辛薩羅找到10瓶腐化之血。任務完成之後就回到斷齒族長那裏。",
    ["Protect Corporal Keeshan on the journey back to Redridge."] = "保護基沙恩下士回到赤脊。",
    ["Protect Kanati Greycloud from the centaur attack."] = "保護卡納提·灰雲免受半人馬的襲擊。",
    ["Protect Volcor until you reach the road, then speak to Terenthis in Auberdine."] = "保護沃科爾離開，然後去和奧伯丁的特倫希斯談壹談。",
    ["Protect Wizzlecrank and the stolen goblin shredder on the way to Sputtervalve in Ratchet."] = "保護維茲克蘭克以及他偷來的地精伐木機返回棘齒城的斯布特瓦夫那裏。",
    ["Put the spirit of Faldrim Anvilmar to rest in the Hall of Thanes."] = "讓法爾椎‧安威瑪的靈魂安息，然後回去找族長之廳的鬼魅侍者。",
    ["Raise the standard of Ironforge, call out the trogg Headsplitter and kill it, then report to Captain Rugelfuss."] = "揚起鐵爐堡的旌旗，呼喚穴居怪劈頭者並將其擊殺，之後去找拉格弗斯上尉回報。",
    ["Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreamwalker Boots if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Boots, 12 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 3 Mooncloth and 2 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的瑞恩將為你製作夢行者長靴，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1雙被褻瀆的長靴，12個受戰爭破壞的皮甲碎塊，3塊月布和2塊熟化毛皮。",
    ["Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreamwalker Handguards if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Handguards, 8 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 5 Cured Rugged Hides and 1 Nexus Crystal."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的瑞恩將為你製作夢行者手甲，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1套被褻瀆的手甲，8個受戰爭破壞的皮甲碎塊，5塊熟化毛皮和1個聯結水晶。",
    ["Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreamwalker Legguards if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Legguards, 20 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 8 Cured Rugged Hides and 1 Nexus Crystal."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的瑞恩將為你製作夢行者腿甲，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1對被褻瀆的腿甲，20個受戰爭破壞的皮甲碎塊，8塊熟化毛皮和1個聯結水晶。",
    ["Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreamwalker Spaulders if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Spaulders, 12 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 5 Cured Rugged Hides and 1 Nexus Crystal."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的瑞恩將為你製作夢行者肩甲，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1對被褻瀆的肩甲，12個受戰爭破壞的皮甲碎塊，5塊熟化毛皮和1個聯結水晶。",
    ["Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreamwalker Wristguards if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Wristguards, 6 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 1 Arcane Crystal and 2 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的瑞恩將為你製作夢行者腕甲，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1對被褻瀆的束腕，6個受戰爭破壞的皮甲碎塊，1個秘法水晶和2塊熟化毛皮。",
    ["Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Dreamwalker Girdle if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Girdle, 8 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 3 Mooncloth and 2 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的瑞恩將為你製作夢行者束腰，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1個被褻瀆的束腰，8個受戰爭破壞的皮甲碎塊，3塊月布和2塊熟化毛皮。",
    ["Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Dreamwalker Headpiece if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Headpiece, 15 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 6 Cured Rugged Hides and 2 Nexus Crystals."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的瑞恩將為你製作夢行者首盔，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1個被褻瀆的首盔，15個受戰爭破壞的皮甲碎塊，6塊熟化毛皮和2個聯結水晶。",
    ["Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Dreamwalker Tunic if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Tunic, 25 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 6 Cured Rugged Hides and 2 Nexus Crystals."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的瑞恩將為你製作夢行者外套，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1件被褻瀆的外套，25個受戰爭破壞的皮甲碎塊，6塊熟化毛皮和2個聯結水晶。",
    ["Reclaim the Skybreaker Bulwark from Zaal Stormshield at the Shrine of Akir."] = "在奧基爾聖殿從札爾‧風暴盾手中奪回破天者壁壘。",
    ["Recover \"Geomancy for Curious Young Wizards\" and \"Arcane Explainer: Magical Stuff in Simple Words\" and return them to Brother Paxton inside Northshire's Abbey."] = "找回《好學年輕巫師的地卜術》和《秘法解析：以簡單的用語解釋魔法》，並還給北郡修道院內的帕克斯頓修士。",
    ["Recover Sha'ni's Nose-Ring from Krom'Grul and return it to Thal'trak in Kargath. Search the various caves and mines in Dreadmaul Rock."] = "從克羅格魯爾手中拿回沙妮的鼻環，把它還給卡加斯的薩特拉克。搜尋巨槌石的每壹處山洞和礦井。",
    ["Recover the 8 lost chapters of Draconic for Dummies and combine them with the Magical Book Binding and return the completed book of Draconic for Dummies: Volume II to Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris."] = "把8章《龍語傻瓜教程》的章節用魔法書封面合起來，然後把完整的《龍語傻瓜教程：第二卷》交給塔納利斯的納瑞安。",
    ["Recover the Sea Turtle Remains from the Skeletal Sea Turtle in the waters west of Auberdine, and then speak with Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde back in Auberdine."] = "在奧伯丁西面海水中的海龜骸骨那裏取回海龜殘骸，然後與奧伯丁的溫尼斯·布萊葛談壹談。",
    ["Report back what you have found to Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea in Auberdine."] = "向奧伯丁的哨兵哨兵戈琳達·納希恩報告妳的發現。",
    ["Report to King Magni Bronzebeard."] = "向鐵爐堡的國王麥格尼·銅須匯報。",
    ["Report to Yorana Windyreed at the eastern watchtower in the Gustberry Lowlands."] = "到風莓低地的東部瞭望塔向優菈娜‧風葦回報。",
    ["Report your findings to First Mate Crazz in Booty Bay."] = "將妳的發現報告給藏寶海灣的大副克拉茲。",
    ["Retrieve 4 Miners' Union Cards and return them to Wilder Thistlenettle in Stormwind."] = "給暴風城的維爾德·薊草帶回4張礦業工會會員卡。",
    ["Retrieve 7 Highborne Relics for Thundris Windweaver in Auberdine."] = "幫奧伯丁的桑迪斯·織風取回7個上層精靈的遺物。",
    ["Retrieve 8 Tumbled Crystals and return them to Kebok in Booty Bay."] = "給藏寶海灣的科博克帶回8塊打磨過的水晶。",
    ["Retrieve Deathguard Humbert's sword from Dun Garok and return it to him in Tarren Mill."] = "從丹加洛克拿回亡靈衛兵亨伯特的長劍，然後回到塔倫米爾把劍還給他。",
    ["Retrieve Haggard's Badge from Dead-tooth Jack's camp, and return to Marshal Haggard."] = "從蛀牙傑克的營地裏取回治安官哈迦德的徽章，把它交給治安官哈迦德。",
    ["Retrieve Marez Cowl's Bloodstone Orb and bring it to Tor'gan in Hammerfall."] = "取回瑪雷茲·考爾的血石寶珠，把它交給落錘村的托爾甘。",
    ["Retrieve Mythology of the Titans from the Monastery and bring it to Librarian Mae Paledust in Ironforge."] = "從修道院拿回《泰坦神話》，把它交給鐵爐堡的圖書館員麥伊·蒼塵。",
    ["Retrieve Tundra MacGrann's dried meats from the stolen meat locker in Old Icebeard's cave."] = "從冰須的洞穴裏拿回裝有馬克格拉恩的幹肉的儲藏櫃。",
    ["Retrieve a Fallen Moonstone from the Shadethicket Oracle, then bring it to Pelturas in Astranaar."] = "從沼澤獸智者那裏取回壹枚隕落的月亮石，並把它帶給阿斯特蘭納的皮爾圖拉斯·懷特姆恩。",
    ["Retrieve the Cloven Hoof for Rau Cliffrunner at the Freewind Post."] = "拿到裂開的蹄子，把它交給亂風崗的勞恩·峭壁行者。",
    ["Retrieve the Compendium of the Fallen from the Monastery in Tirisfal Glades and return to Sage Truthseeker in Thunder Bluff."] = "從血色修道院裏找到《墮落者綱要》，把它交給雷霆崖的聖者圖希克。",
    ["Retrieve the Gnoam Sprecklesprocket from the Deadmines and return it to Shoni the Shilent in Stormwind."] = "從死亡礦井中帶回小型高能發動機，將其帶給暴風城矮人區中的沈默的舒尼。",
    ["Retrieve the Relics of Wakening and bring them to Athridas Bearmantle in Dolanaar."] = "尋回四件喚醒聖物,把它們帶給多蘭納爾的阿斯瑞達斯·熊皮。",
    ["Retrieve the Rig Blueprints and Thermaplugg's Safe Combination from Gnomeregan and bring them to Nogg in Orgrimmar."] = "從諾莫瑞根拿到鉆探設備藍圖和麥克尼爾的保險箱密碼，把它們交給奧格瑞瑪的諾格。",
    ["Retrieve the Shipment of Boots and Telescopic Lens for Gazlowe in Ratchet."] = "幫棘齒城的加茲魯維取回壹箱靴子以及壹塊望遠鏡片。",
    ["Return 8 Smooth Boulders to Thra behind Grommash Hold."] = "將8個光滑巨石送去給葛羅瑪許堡後方的絲拉。",
    ["Return the Modified Seaforium Booster to Razzeric on the Shimmering Flats."] = "將改進型爆鹽增壓器還給閃光平原的拉澤瑞克。",
    ["Return the Remains of Trey Lightforge to Jessir Moonbow in Felwood."] = "將特雷·萊弗治的殘骸交給費伍德森林的傑希爾·月弓。",
    ["Return the Samophlange to Sputtervalve in Ratchet."] = "把主動式負載平衡器交給棘齒城的斯布特瓦夫。",
    ["Return the Sparkling Stone and the Stave of Equinex to Troyas Moonbreeze in Feathermoon Stronghold."] = "將閃光的石頭和艾奎尼克斯法杖交給羽月要塞的特洛亞斯·月風。",
    ["Return the monogrammed silver hair clip to its owner."] = "把刺著字母的銀色髮夾還給它的主人。",
    ["Return to Belgrom Rockmaul in Orgrimmar."] = "回到奧格瑞瑪的貝爾戈洛姆·石槌那兒。",
    ["Return to Brother Kristoff in the Cathedral Square. Give him the book The Stresses of Iron."] = "回到教堂廣場，將《金屬的延展性》交給克裏斯托弗修士。",
    ["Return to Kreldig Ungor in Desolace."] = "回到淒涼之地的克雷迪格·安戈爾那裏。",
    ["Return to Mokvar in Orgimmar with a set of Dreadmist Sandals, Dreadmist Leggings and Dreadmist Mantle."] = "帶著鬼霧便鞋，鬼霧護腿和鬼霧襯肩回到奧格瑪的莫克瓦那裡。",
    ["Return to Thunder Bluff and show Turak Runetotem the Pendant of the Sea Lion."] = "回到雷霆崖，讓圖拉克·符文圖騰看看妳的海獅墜飾。",
    ["Return to Thyn'tel Bladeweaver in Darnassus."] = "回到達納蘇斯去見珊蒂斯·羽月。",
    ["Return to the Scholomance with the Blood of Innocents. Find the porch and place the Blood of Innocents in the brazier. Kirtonos will come to feast upon your soul.Fight valiantly, do not give an inch! Destroy Kirtonos and return to Eva Sarkhoff."] = "帶著無辜者之血回到通靈學院，將它放在門廊的火盆下面，基爾圖諾斯會前來吞噬妳的靈魂。  勇敢地戰鬥吧，不要退縮！殺死基爾圖諾斯，然後回到艾瓦·薩克霍夫那兒。",
    ["Rhag Garmason wants you to locate Ol' Rustlocke."] = "拉格·加瑪森要求妳找到老伊本瑟。",
    ["Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Earthshatter Boots if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Boots, 12 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 3 Nexus Crystals."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的林布拉特·大地粉碎者將為你製作粉碎大地長靴，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1套被褻瀆的長靴，12個受戰爭破壞的鍊甲碎塊，1個奧金錠和3個聯結水晶。",
    ["Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Earthshatter Handguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Handguards, 8 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 5 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的林布拉特·大地粉碎者將為你製作粉碎大地手甲，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1套被褻瀆的手甲，8個受戰爭破壞的鍊甲碎塊，1個奧金錠和5塊熟化毛皮。",
    ["Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Earthshatter Legguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Legguards, 20 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 3 Arcanite Bars and 5 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的林布拉特·大地粉碎者將為你製作粉碎大地腿甲，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1對被褻瀆的腿甲，20個受戰爭破壞的鍊甲碎塊，3個奧金錠和5塊熟化毛皮。",
    ["Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Earthshatter Spaulders if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Spaulders, 12 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 2 Arcanite Bars and 2 Mooncloth."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的林布拉特·大地粉碎者將為你製作粉碎大地肩甲，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1套被褻瀆的肩甲，12個受戰爭破壞的鍊甲碎塊，2個奧金錠和2塊月布。",
    ["Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Earthshatter Wristguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Wristguards, 6 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 2 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的林布拉特·大地粉碎者將為你製作粉碎大地腕甲，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1對被褻瀆的束腕，6個受戰爭破壞的鍊甲碎塊，1個奧金錠和2塊熟化毛皮。",
    ["Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make an Earthshatter Girdle if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Girdle, 8 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 3 Nexus Crystals."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的林布拉特·大地粉碎者將為你製作粉碎大地束腰，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1個被褻瀆的束腰，8個受戰爭破壞的鍊甲碎塊，1個奧金錠和3個聯結水晶。",
    ["Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make an Earthshatter Headpiece if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Headpiece, 15 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 2 Nexus Crystals."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的林布拉特·大地粉碎者將為你製作粉碎大地首盔，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1個被褻瀆的首盔，15個受戰爭破壞的鍊甲碎塊，4個奧金錠和2個聯結水晶。",
    ["Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make an Earthshatter Tunic if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Tunic, 25 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的林布拉特·大地粉碎者將為你製作粉碎大地外套，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1件被褻瀆的外套，25個受戰爭破壞的鍊甲碎塊，4個奧金錠和3塊熟化毛皮。",
    ["Rohan the Assassin at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Bonescythe Sabatons if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Sabatons, 12 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 3 Cured Rugged Hides, 2 Nexus Crystals and 25 gold pieces."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的『刺客』羅漢將為你製作骨鐮重靴，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1雙被褻瀆的馬靴，12個受戰爭破壞的皮甲碎塊，3塊熟化毛皮，2個聯結水晶和25金。",
    ["Rohan the Assassin at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Bonescythe Waistguard if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Waistguard, 8 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 5 Cured Rugged Hides, 1 Nexus Crystal and 15 gold pieces."] = "東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂的『刺客』羅漢將為你製作骨鐮護腰，只要你將下列物品帶給他:1個被褻瀆的護腰，8個受戰爭破壞的皮甲碎塊，5塊熟化毛皮，1個聯結水晶和15金。",
    ["Rudra Amberstill wants you to slay Vagash and bring his fang to her at the Ram ranch."] = "山羊農場的魯德拉·凍石要妳殺了瓦加什，並且把它的牙齒給她帶回去。",
    ["Safely escort Gilthares Firebough back to Captain Brightsun in Ratchet."] = "護送基爾薩瑞斯·火枝安全地返回棘齒城的沙羅薩斯船長那裏。",
    ["Salfa wants you to kill 8 Winterfall Shaman, 8 Winterfall Den Watchers, and 8 Winterfall Ursa. Salfa is located just outside the entrance to Timbermaw Hold in Winterspring."] = "薩爾法要妳去殺死8個冬泉薩滿祭司、8個冬泉巢穴守衛和8個冬泉巨熊怪。薩爾法就站在冬泉谷的木喉要塞入口處。",
    ["Salma Saldean wants 3 Stringy Vulture Meat, 3 Goretusk Snouts, 3 Murloc Eyes, 3 Okra."] = "薩爾瑪·薩丁需要3塊禿鷲肉條、3只血牙野豬的頭、3顆魚人的眼睛和3棵秋葵。",
    ["Scout Riell at the Sentinel Hill Tower wants you to bring her 10 Red Silk Bandanas."] = "給哨兵嶺哨塔的哨兵瑞爾帶回10條紅色絲質面罩。",
    ["Search Deathknell and the vicinity for 6 pieces of Scavenged Goods, and return them to Deathguard Saltain."] = "在喪鐘鎮及臨近地區搜尋6件破爛裝備，把它們交給亡靈衛兵薩爾坦。",
    ["Search Shatter Scar Vale in Felwood for the remains of Kroshius. When you locate the remains, use the Fel Fire near them and await Kroshius' return. When the infernal has awoken, slay him and take from his corpse Kroshius' Infernal Core.Return Kroshius' Infernal Core to Niby the Almighty in Felwood."] = "在費伍德森林的碎痕谷中搜尋克羅蘇斯的屍體。當妳找到屍體後，在他身上使用魔火，並等待克羅蘇斯復生。當這個地獄火被喚醒之後，幹掉他，從他的身上拿取克羅蘇斯的惡魔之核。  把克羅蘇斯的惡魔之核交給費伍德森林的尼比。",
    ["Security Chief Bilgewhizzle of Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris wants you to kill 10 Southsea Pirates, 10 Southsea Freebooters, 10 Southsea Dock Workers and 10 Southsea Swashbucklers."] = "塔納利斯熱砂港的安全主管吉羅姆·比格維茲要妳去幹掉10個南海海盜、10個南海劫掠者、10個南海碼頭工人和10個南海流氓。",
    ["Seek audience with High Chieftain Cairne Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff."] = "晉見雷霆崖的牛頭人酋長凱恩‧血蹄。",
    ["Set the North, South, East, and West Sentry Towers on fire by using the Torch of Retribution inside each of the buildings."] = "使用懲戒火炬點燃北部、南部、東部和西部的哨塔。",
    ["Shadow Priest Sarvis wants you to kill 8 Mindless Zombies and 8 Wretched Zombies."] = "暗影牧師薩維斯讓妳殺掉8個無腦的僵屍和8個醜陋的僵屍。",
    ["Show Tooga the way back to his wife, Torta."] = "把圖加帶回到他的妻子托爾塔身邊。",
    ["Sir S. J. Erlgadin of Nesingwary's Expedition wants you to bring him the Fang of Bhag'thera."] = "奈辛瓦裏遠征隊的埃爾加丁爵士要求妳殺死巴爾瑟拉，並帶回它的牙。",
    ["Slay 15 Crushridge Warmongers, then return to Marshal Redpath in Southshore."] = "殺死15個破碎嶺好戰者，然後回南海鎮向治安官雷德帕斯報告。",
    ["Slay 6 Windshaper Novice Seers in Shen'dar Highlands."] = "在申德高地殺死6名塑風者見習先知。",
    ["Slay 8 Ursera Scavengers and collect the head of the den mother, Urs'anah in Thendal Grove."] = "在坦德爾林地殺死8隻熊獸食腐者並取得巢母厄沙納的頭顱。",
    ["Slay 8 Vile Fin Attackers and 8 Vile Fin Seers and report back to Breton Samuels when it is done."] = "殺死8個邪鰭攻擊者和8個邪鰭先知，成功後再向布瑞頓‧山繆斯回報。",
    ["Slay 8 Vuldren Juveniles in Thendal Grove."] = "在坦德爾林地殺死8隻弗德飛狐幼崽。",
    ["Slay Agmond's killer, Murdaloc.Slay 12 Stonevault Bonesnappers.Report to Prospector Ironband in Loch Modan."] = "幹掉殺害阿戈莫德的兇手：莫達洛克。  順便殺掉12個石窟斷骨者。  然後向洛克莫丹的勘察員基恩薩·鐵環報告。",
    ["Slay Alliance soldiers encroaching into the Barrens at the border to Dustwallow Marsh, then return to Grunt Logmar at Camp Taurajo."] = "在通往塵泥沼澤的邊境殺死進逼貧瘠之地的聯盟士兵，之後回到陶拉祖營地找步兵勞格瑪。",
    ["Slay Arikara. Bring her remains and the Incendia powder to Motega Firemane in Whitereach Post as proof of your deed."] = "殺死阿利卡拉。把她的遺體和火巖粉交給白沙崗哨的莫特加·火鬃作為證明。",
    ["Slay Commander Belguilos in the Gustberry Lowlands."] = "在風莓低地殺死指揮官貝吉蘿絲。",
    ["Slay Frosthowl and collect the Sack of Fish for Gretta Ganter in Brewnall Village."] = "為烈酒村的格雷塔‧甘特殺死霜嚎並收集一袋魚",
    ["Slay Lathoric the Black and Obsidion, and return to Thorius in Ironforge with the Head of Lathoric the Black and the Heart of Obsidion."] = "殺死黑衣拉索裏克和奧比斯頓，帶著黑衣拉索裏克的頭顱和奧比斯頓的心臟回到鐵爐堡的索裏奧斯那兒。",
    ["Slay Lord Azrethoc and Jugkar Grim'rod and return to Takata Steelblade in Desolace."] = "殺掉魔王阿茲雷索克和祖格卡，然後向淒涼之地的塔卡塔·鋼刃復命。",
    ["Slay Nefarian and recover the Red Scepter Shard. Return the Red Scepter Shard to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris. You have 5 hours to complete this task."] = "幹掉奈法利安並拿到紅色節杖碎片。把紅色節杖碎片帶給塔納利斯時光之穴門口的阿納克洛斯。妳必須在5小時之內完成這個任務。",
    ["Slay Or'Kalar and bring his Head to Korin Fel in the Hammerfall outpost."] = "殺死奧卡拉爾，將他的頭顱帶給落錘村哨所的科林法爾。",
    ["Slay Princess Theradras and return to Selendra near Shadowprey Village in Desolace."] = "殺死瑟萊德絲公主，然後回到淒涼之地葬影村附近的瑟琳德拉那裏復命。",
    ["Slay Serena Bloodfeather and return her head to Darsok Swiftdagger at the Crossroads."] = "殺掉塞瑞娜·血羽，把她的頭顱交給十字路口的達索克·快刀。",
    ["Slay Trade Master Kovic and his minion Clunk. Retrieve the Trader's Satchel from his corpse and return it to Nilith."] = "殺了貿易首領考維克和他的同夥科朗克。從他的屍體上拿回商人的背包，把它交給尼莉絲。",
    ["Slay the beast and bring back the Hypercapacitor Gizmo and Panther Cage Key to Wizlo Bearingshiner."] = "殺了那頭野獸，把超適應齒輪和鑰匙交給維茲羅。",
    ["Slay the gnoll Hogger and bring his Huge Gnoll Claw to Marshal Dughan."] = "殺死豺狼人霍格，把他那巨大的豺狼人爪帶給治安官杜漢。",
    ["Speak to Belgrom Rockmaul in Orgrimmar."] = "與奧格瑞瑪的貝爾戈洛姆·石槌談壹談。",
    ["Speak to Keldran in Orgrimmar."] = "與奧格瑞瑪的科爾丹談壹談。",
    ["Speak to Mikhail in the Wetlands."] = "與濕地的米克哈爾談壹談。",
    ["Speak with Acolyte Dellis in Stormwind."] = "與暴風城裏的助手迪利斯談壹談。",
    ["Speak with Alvarion Windfield in Valanaar."] = "和瓦拉納爾的亞瓦里安‧荒原談話。",
    ["Speak with Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus."] = "與達納蘇斯的大德魯伊範達爾·鹿盔談壹談。",
    ["Speak with Delgren the Purifier at Maestra's Post after seeing Feero safely through Ashenvale Forest."] = "護送費羅·艾隆漢安全地穿越灰谷森林，然後和邁斯特拉崗哨的凈化者德爾格倫談壹談。",
    ["Speak with Fizzle Brassbolts in the Shimmering Flats."] = "和閃光平原的菲茲爾·銅栓談壹談。",
    ["Speak with Lieutenant Doren."] = "與多倫上尉談壹談。",
    ["Speak with Mura Runetotem in the Sepulcher."] = "和瑟伯切爾的茉拉·符文圖騰談壹談。",
    ["Speak with Overlord Mok'Morokk in Brackenwall Village."] = "和蕨墻村的莫格穆洛克大王談壹談。",
    ["Speak with Rabine Saturna in the village of Nighthaven, Moonglade."] = "與月光林地永夜港的拉比恩·薩圖納談壹談。",
    ["Speak with Shandris Feathermoon in Feathermoon Stronghold."] = "與羽月要塞的珊蒂斯·羽月談壹談。",
    ["Speak with Valennia Stormfist in Valanaar and follow her instructions."] = "在瓦拉納爾和維菈妮雅‧颶拳交談，並遵照她的指示行動。",
    ["Speak with Zggi, the servant of Zardeth the Blackclaw, to claim your reward."] = "去找黑爪加爾德斯的仆人茲吉談壹談，並向他索要妳的酬勞。",
    ["Sten Stoutarm would like 8 pieces of Tough Wolf Meat."] = "斯登·粗臂想要8塊硬狼肉。",
    ["Storm Shadowhoof at Everlook in Winterspring wants you to defeat Shy-Rotam."] = "永望鎮的斯托姆·影蹄想要妳去殺死希洛塔姆。",
    ["String 5 Channeler's Heads, then return the Collection of Troll Heads to Exzhal on Yojamba Isle."] = "將神聖之索穿上5顆導魔師的頭顱，然後把這壹串頭顱交給尤亞姆巴島上的伊克薩爾。",
    ["Take Brann Bronzebeard's Letter to Bronzebeard's Encampment in southern Silithus."] = "將布萊恩·銅須的信件帶往希利蘇斯南部的銅須營地。",
    ["Take Darthalia's Sealed Commendation to Varimathras in the Undercity."] = "把達薩利亞的獎狀交給幽暗城的瓦裏瑪薩斯。",
    ["Take Gor'tesh's Lopped Off Head and place it at the top of Dreadmaul Rock. Look for a soft dirt mound to plant the pike."] = "把戈泰什的頭顱放在巨槌石的山頂上。找壹塊軟土堆把串著頭顱的長矛插上去就可以了。",
    ["Take Jer'kai's Signet Ring to High Priestess Tyrande Whisperwind in Darnassus."] = "將耶爾卡的徽記之戒交給達納蘇斯的高階女祭司泰蘭德·語風。",
    ["Take Marshal McBride's Documents to Marshal Dughan in Goldshire."] = "將治安官瑪克布萊德的文件帶給閃金鎮的治安官杜漢。",
    ["Take Sarah Ladimore's ring to Morgan Ladimore's grave."] = "把莎拉·拉迪莫爾的戒指拿到摩根·拉迪莫爾的墳墓上去。",
    ["Take the Blue-feathered Necklace to Nara Wildmane."] = "把藍羽項鏈交給納拉·蠻鬃。",
    ["Take the Eye of C'Thun to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time."] = "把克蘇恩之眼交給時光之穴的阿納克洛斯。",
    ["Take the Grimtotem Satchel to Rahauro in Thunder Bluff."] = "將恐怖圖騰背包交給雷霆崖的拉哈羅。",
    ["Take the Index Esoteria to the Overlook Standing Stones in Shen'dar Highlands and use it once there. Protect the Index from harm as it gathers data."] = "帶著奧秘索引前往申德高地的瞰臺矗立之石，並對該區域的風石岩層使用奧秘索引以蒐集資料。",
    ["Take the Sealed Letter to Archmage Malin in the Mage Quarter of Stormwind."] = "將給大法師馬林的信交給暴風城法師區裏的大法師馬林。",
    ["Take the Small Scroll to Varimathras in the Undercity."] = "把小卷軸交給幽暗城的瓦裏瑪薩斯。",
    ["Take the Woven Wand to Bethor Iceshard in the Magic Quarter of the Undercity."] = "將狼人魔杖帶給幽暗城法師區的比索·埃斯沙德。",
    ["Take the copy of Goodsteel's Ledger and then find the items listed in it before seeking Krinkle Goodsteel in Tanaris."] = "把古德斯迪爾的賬本和上面所列的物品交給塔納利斯的克林科·古德斯迪爾。",
    ["Talin Keeneye would like you to kill 12 Small Crag Boars."] = "塔林·銳眼讓妳去殺掉12只小型峭壁野豬。",
    ["Talk to Delgren the Purifier at Maestra's Post."] = "和邁斯特拉崗哨的凈化者德爾格倫談壹談。",
    ["Talo Thornhoof in Camp Mojache wants Edana Hatetalon's Dark Heart."] = "莫沙徹營地的塔羅·刺蹄要妳給他拿去艾丹娜·邪爪的黑心。",
    ["Tharg in Brackenwall Village wants you to kill 15 Firemane Scouts, 10 Firemane Ash Tails, and 5 Firemane Guards."] = "蕨墻村的薩爾格要妳去殺掉15個火鬃斥候，10個火鬃灰尾龍人和5個火鬃守衛。",
    ["The Disarming Mixture seemed to take effect.  Return to Chief Engineer Hinderweir to report the good news."] = "拆彈劑看來已經產生了效果。妳可以回去向主工程師辛德維爾七世匯報這個好消息了。",
    ["The Scarlet Crusade is on the move. Somewhere along the road from Tyr's Hand to Stratholme you will find the Oracle, Demetria, and her entourage. Hunt her down and slay her. Return to Nathanos Blightcaller should you succeed."] = "血色十字軍正在從提爾之手到斯坦索姆的路上巡邏，妳可以在巡邏隊中找到聖者德米提雅和她的隨從，找到並殺死她。如果妳成功了，就回到納薩諾斯·雕零者那裏去復命。",
    ["Travel to Falfindel Waywarder on the border of Thousand Needles and Feralas."] = "在千針石林與菲拉斯的邊境上找到法芬德爾。",
    ["Travel to Fire Plume Ridge, south of Marshal's Refuge.Find Blazerunner and use the totem to remove his protective aura. Once he has been defeated, acquire the Golden Flame from the cave."] = "到馬紹爾營地南邊的火羽山去。  找到火焰使者，並使用圖騰除掉它的防護光環。在擊敗它之後從洞中取得金色火焰。",
    ["Travel to Plaguewood, northwest of Light's Hope. Destroy 8 Scourge Structures by using Smokey's Special Compound at the Mark of Detonation planted inside each building. Smokey has had the Ziggurats and Slaughterhouses marked.Once you plant the bomb, leave the building and marvel at your handiwork.By the way, Smokey's Special Compound is rather... unstable."] = "到聖光之願禮拜堂西北方的病木林去。在那些有爆炸標記的建築物中對爆炸標記使用煙鬼的特殊混合物，以此來摧毀8座亡靈天災建築。煙鬼已經給通靈塔和屠宰房做上了標記。  壹旦妳放置好炸彈，就離那些建築物遠壹些，然後盡情欣賞妳的傑作吧。  順便說壹句，煙鬼的特殊混合物相當不穩定……",
    ["Travel to Stratholme, in the north. Search the supply crates that litter the city and recover 5 Stratholme Holy Water. Return to Leonid Barthalomew the Revered when you have collected enough of the blessed fluid."] = "到北方的斯坦索姆去，尋找散落在城市中的補給箱，並收集5瓶斯坦索姆聖水。當妳找到足夠的聖水之後就回去向萊尼德·巴薩羅梅復命。",
    ["Travel to the Den on Stonetalon Peak. Using the Gatekeeper's Key, obtain the druids' hidden items. Use these items to open the Talon Den Hoard."] = "到石爪峰上的洞穴中去，使用守門人的鑰匙拿到能打開石爪峰頂的猛禽洞穴儲藏室的物品。",
    ["Travel to the ruins of Falaath Village and slay 6 Al'Aketh Stormcallers, 4 Living Lightning and take the head of Commander Cyclas."] = "前往法拉斯村遺跡，殺死6個奧拉凱斯風暴召喚者、4個活體閃電，並砍下指揮官賽拉斯的頭。",
    ["Use Morbent's Bane on Morbent Fel, kill Morbent Fel, then return Morbent's Bane to Sven at his camp."] = "對摩本特·費爾使用摩本特的克星，殺掉他，然後把摩本特的克星交給斯溫。",
    ["Use Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker to zap any kind of giant found in Feralas into a more manageable form. Bring 15 Miniaturization Residues found on the zapped versions of these giants to Zorbin Fandazzle at the docks of the Forgotten Coast, Feralas."] = "使用索爾賓的超級壓縮器來縮小菲拉斯的任意種類的巨人，將他們縮小到更容易控制的體積。從縮小過的巨人身上收集15份微縮殘渣，把它們交給菲拉斯被遺忘的海岸碼頭的索爾賓·範達瑟。",
    ["Use the Arcanite Buoy at the Swirling Maelstrom at the Bay of Storms in Azshara."] = "在艾薩拉風暴海灣一帶的大漩渦使用奧金浮標。",
    ["Use the Curative Animal Salve on 10 Sickly Deer that are located throughout Darkshore; doing so should cure them. Sickly Deer have been reported starting south of the Cliffspring River to the north of Auberdine and extending all the way into southern Darkshore where the edge of Ashenvale begins."] = "對黑海岸的10頭生病的鹿使用動物醫療藥膏，以此來治療它們。從壁泉河到奧伯丁，直到最南端靠近灰谷的地區都有生病的鹿出沒。",
    ["Use the Divination Scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement in the Scholomance. Doing so will bring forth spirits you must fight. Defeating these spirits will summon forth Death Knight Darkreaver; defeat him.Bring Darkreaver's Head to Sagorne Creststrider in the Valley of Wisdom, Orgrimmar."] = "在通靈學院地下室的屍骨儲藏所的中心使用預言水晶球，然後與被召喚出來的幽靈作戰。擊敗這些幽靈之後，死亡騎士達克雷爾才會出現，妳的任務就是擊敗他。  把死亡騎士達克雷爾的徽記交給奧格瑞瑪智慧谷的薩格尼。",
    ["Use the Sign of the Earth to activate the Pillars of Amethyst, Opal, and Diamond and obtain the Runestones.Place the runestones in the Seal of the Earth to free Blacklash and Hematus.Slay them and return Blacklash's Bindings, the Chains of Hematus, and the Sign of the Earth to Garek."] = "用大地印章激活鉆石柱、瑪瑙石柱和紫水晶石柱並拿到三顆符石。  把符石放在大地封印上，釋放黑龍布萊克拉什和赫瑪圖斯。  殺了這兩條黑龍，把布萊克拉什的鎖鏈、赫瑪圖斯的鎖鏈和大地印章交給加瑞克。",
    ["Use the Small Brass Key to open Bookie Herod's Strongbox."] = "使用黃銅鑰匙打開書呆子赫羅德的保險箱。",
    ["Use the Temporal Displacer near one of Andorhal's silos and uncover Temporal Parasites.Slay 15 Temporal Parasites, and then return the Temporal Displacer to Chromie in the Andorhal Inn, Western Plaguelands."] = "在安多哈爾的壹處倉庫附近使用時光置換器，使時光寄生蟲現身。  殺掉15只時光寄生蟲，然後將時光置換器還給西瘟疫之地安多哈爾旅店的克羅米。",
    ["Use the Thunderhorn Cleansing Totem at the Thunderhorn Water Well, then return to Mull."] = "在雷角之井使用雷角之井凈化圖騰，然後回來見穆爾。",
    ["Use the Wildmane Cleansing Totem at the Wildmane Water Well, then return to Mull Thunderhorn."] = "在蠻鬃之井使用蠻鬃之井凈化圖騰，然後回來見穆爾·雷角。",
    ["Using the contents of Torwa's Pouch, summon Lar'korwi and defeat him. Then bring Lar'korwi's Head to Torwa Pathfinder near the entrance to Un'Goro Crater."] = "使用托爾瓦的麻袋中的東西召喚拉克維並打敗它。將拉克維的頭顱交給安戈洛環形山入口處的托爾瓦·尋路者。",
    ["Venture to the Valley of Heroes in Stormwind City and speak with Field Marshal Afrasiabi."] = "回到暴風城的英雄谷，與艾法希比元帥談壹談。",
    ["Wait for Galvan to finish forging the weaponry."] = "等待加爾文為妳鍛造武器。",
    ["Wait for Jordan Stilwell to finish forging a weapon for you."] = "等待喬丹·斯迪威爾為妳鑄造武器。",
    ["Wait for Menara Voidrender to complete the Orb of Dar'Orahil and then speak to her again."] = "等待梅納拉·沃倫德完成達奧拉赫寶珠，然後再與她談壹談。",
    ["Wait for Menara Voidrender to complete the Orb of Noh'Orahil and then speak to her again."] = "等待梅納拉·沃倫德完成諾奧拉赫寶珠，然後再與她談壹談。",
    ["Wait for Menara Voidrender to complete your robe and then speak to her again."] = "等待梅納拉·沃倫德織好披風，然後跟她談壹談。",
    ["Witch Doctor Jin'Zil at Malaka'jin wants 5 portions of Stonetalon Sap, 5 Twilight Whiskers, 30 Courser Eyes and a Fey Dragon Scale."] = "瑪拉卡金的巫醫金吉爾需要5瓶石爪苔液、5根夜行虎須、30顆巨角鹿的眼球和1塊靈龍的鱗片。",
    ["Witch Doctor Uzer'i wants you to wait for a moment while he prepares the weapons."] = "巫醫尤克裏希望妳在他準備武器的時候稍等壹會兒。",
    ["You have been ordered to slay Vile Priestess Hexx and 20 Vilebranch Aman'zasi Guards. See Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands once this task is complete.Vile Priestess Hexx and the Aman'zasi Guards can be found atop Jintha'alor in the Hinterlands."] = "妳必須殺掉邪惡祭司海克斯和20名邪枝精英守衛。任務完成之後回到辛特蘭的惡齒村，向斷齒族長報告。  妳可以在辛特蘭的邪枝巨魔城市辛薩羅的頂部找到他們。",
    ["You have been tasked with the decimation of 20 Vilebranch Berserkers, 20 Vilebranch Shadow Hunters, 20 Vilebranch Blood Drinkers, and 20 Vilebranch Soul Eaters.Should you complete this task, return to Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands."] = "妳必須消滅20個邪枝狂戰士、20個邪枝暗影獵手、20個邪枝飲血者和20個邪枝噬魂者。  完成任務之後向辛特蘭惡齒村的斷齒族長復命。",
}) do objectives[k] = v end
